INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Soju06/codex-lb/codex-review-loop', 'codex-review-loop', 'Soju06', 'codex-lb', 'community', 'codex-review-loop Soju06 codex-lb community api-proxy chatgpt codex dashboard fastapi load-balancer oauth openai opencode python rate-limit sqlalchemy usage-tracking The codex-review-loop skill provides a load balancer and proxy for Codex/ChatGPT accounts, with usage tracking and a dashboard. It benefits developers by automating adversarial code review via Codex CLI. Codex Review Loop 是一个 Codex/ChatGPT 账户负载均衡器和代理，具有使用追踪、仪表盘和 OpenCode 兼容端点 Codex Review Loop は、Codex/ChatGPT アカウントのロードバランサーとプロキシであり、使用状況の追跡、ダッシュボード、OpenCode 互換エンドポイントを備えています Codex Review Loop는 Codex/ChatGPT 계정의 로드 밸런서 및 프록시로, 사용 추적, 대시보드 및 OpenCode 호환 엔드포인트를 제공합니다 Codex Review Loop es una herramienta de revisión de código que utiliza Codex CLI y ofrece funcionalidades como balanceador de carga y seguimiento de uso Codex Review Loop est un outil de revue de code qui utilise Codex CLI et offre des fonctionnalités comme équilibreur de charge et suivi d''utilisation Codex Review Loop ist ein Code-Review-Tool, das Codex CLI verwendet und Funktionen wie Lastenausgleich und Nutzungsverfolgung bietet O Codex Review Loop é uma ferramenta de revisão de código que utiliza o Codex CLI e oferece recursos como proxy de API, balanceamento de carga e rastreamento de uso. Codex Review Loop - это инструмент кодового обзора, использующий Codex CLI и предлагающий функции, такие как прокси API, балансировка нагрузки и отслеживание использования. حلقة مراجعة Codex هي أداة مراجعة الكود التي تستخدم Codex CLI وتقدم ميزات مثل وكيل API وتنظيم الحمل ومراقبة الاستخدام. how to use codex-review-loop codex-review-loop setup guide codex-review-loop vs load balancer codex-review-loop install what is codex-review-loop codex-review-loop alternative codex-review-loop and OpenCode codex-review-loop API proxy codex-review-loop OAuth setup codex-review-loop rate limiting AI 代理 Codex Review Loop 负载均衡 追踪 OpenCode FastAPI SQLAlchemy OAuth rate-limit Codex CLI Launches adversarial review via Codex CLI with optional re-verification Supports rate-limiting and OAuth for secure authentication Provides a dashboard for usage tracking and monitoring Utilizes SQLAlchemy for database management Compatible with OpenCode endpoints for seamless integration Allows for review of uncommitted local changes with --uncommitted flag codex-review-loop is a Python-based API proxy and load balancer with usage tracking, dashboard, and OpenCode-compatible endpoints for Codex/ChatGPT accounts.');
