htungsleitfaden für convex-component-authoring","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Componentes Convex","ru":"Настройка компонентов Convex: ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد مكونات Convex"},"description":{"en":"Unlock reusable Convex components with our expert authoring guide. Learn how to create self-contained components with proper isolation and dependency managem...","zh":"学习 Convex 组件的创建和管理，提高项目的可重用性和可维护性","ja":"Convex コンポーネントの作成と管理を学び、プロジェクトの再利用性と保守性を向上させましょう - AIエージェント","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트의 작성과 관리를 배우고 프로젝트의 재사용성과 유지보수를 향상시키세요 - AI Tools","es":"Aprende a crear componentes Convex reutilizables con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados","fr":"Découvrez comment créer des composants Convex réutilisables avec isolation et gestion de dépendances appropriées","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a criar componentes Convex reutilizáveis com isolamento adequado, exportação e gerenciamento de dependências","ru":"Создавайте компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортом и управлением зависимостями для ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع العزل والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات"},"definition":{"en":"Convex-component-authoring is a skill that allows developers to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.","zh":"Convex 组件是指具有独立功能和依赖管理的可重用代码单元","ja":"Convex コンポーネントとは、独立した機能と依存関係管理を備えた再利用可能なコード単位のことです","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트는 독립적인 기능과 종속성 관리를 갖춘 재사용 가능한 코드 단위입니다","es":"Convex-component-authoring es una técnica para crear componentes Convex reutilizables","fr":"Convex-component-authoring est une technique pour créer des composants Convex réutilisables","de":"Convex-component-authoring ist eine Technik zur Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Convex-Komponenten","pt":"Componentes Convex são módulos self-contidos e reutilizáveis","ru":"Компоненты Convex - это самодостаточные и повторно используемые модули","ar":"المكونات Convex هي وحدات مستقلة قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"},"features":{"en":["Creates self-contained Convex components with proper isolation","Supports exports and dependency management for sharing across projects","Follows documentation guidelines from https://docs.convex.dev/components","Utilizes component authoring guidelines from https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","References broader context from https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt","Enables developers to fetch the latest documentation for implementation"],"zh":["自包含的组件结构","适当的隔离和导出","依赖管理和版本控制","支持多项目和多环境","基于Convex文档的组件作者指南"],"ja":["自己完結したコンポーネント構造","適切な分離とエクスポート","依存関係管理とバージョン管理","複数プロジェクトと環境のサポート","Convexドキュメントベースのコンポーネント作成ガイド"],"ko":["독립적인 컴포넌트 구조","적절한 분리와 내보내기","종속성 관리와 버전 관리","다중 프로젝트와 환경의 지원","Convex 문서 기반의 컴포넌트 작성 가이드"],"es":["Crea componentes Convex reutilizables","Aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados","Exports y gestión de dependencias","Documentación en https://docs.convex.dev/components","Compatibilidad con componentes personalizados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Créez des composants Convex réutilisables","Isolation et gestion de dépendances appropriées","Exports et gestion de dépendances","Documentation sur https://docs.convex.dev/components","Compatibilité avec des composants personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Erstellen Sie wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten","Ordentliche Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Exports und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Dokumentation auf https://docs.convex.dev/components","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Komponenten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex com isolamento adequado","Exportação de componentes Convex para uso em vários projetos","Gerenciamento de dependências para componentes Convex","Uso da documentação oficial Convex para componentes","Implementação de componentes Convex com base na documentação"],"ru":["Создание компонентов Convex с правильной изоляцией","Экспорт компонентов Convex для использования в нескольких проектах","Управление зависимостями для компонентов Convex","Использование официальной документации Convex для компонентов","Реализация компонентов Convex на основе документации"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex مع عزل مناسب","تصدير مكونات Convex لاستخدامها في مشاريع متعددة","إدارة التبعيات لمكونات Convex","استخدام وثائق Convex الرسمية لمكونات","تنفيذ مكونات Convex بالاعتماد على الوثائق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use convex-component-authoring","what is convex-component-authoring","convex-component-authoring alternative","convex-component-authoring vs component-based architecture","convex-component-authoring install","convex-component-authoring setup guide","convex-component-authoring documentation","convex-component-authoring tutorial","convex-component-authoring best practices"],"zh":["Convex组件","Convex组件创建","Convex组件管理","可重用组件","依赖管理","Convex文档","组件作者指南","AI开发工具"],"ja":["Convexコンポーネント","Convexコンポーネント作成","Convexコンポーネント管理","再利用可能なコンポーネント","依存関係管理","Convexドキュメント","コンポーネント作成ガイド","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","Convex 컴포넌트 작성","Convex 컴포넌트 관리","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","종속성 관리","Convex 문서","컴포넌트 작성 가이드","AI Tools"],"es":["convex-component-authoring","componentes Convex reutilizables","aislamiento y gestión de dependencias","exports y gestión de dependencias","documentación Convex","herramientas de desarrollo","componentes personalizados","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["convex-component-authoring","composants Convex réutilisables","isolation et gestion de dépendances","exports et gestion de dépendances","documentation Convex","outils de développement","composants personnalisés","intégration avec des outils de développement","développement de logiciels"],"de":["convex-component-authoring","wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten","Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Exports und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Convex-Dokumentation","Entwicklungstools","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["componentes Convex","criação de componentes Convex","exportação de componentes Convex","gerenciamento de dependências Convex","documentação Convex","componentes reutilizáveis","isolamento de componentes","desenvolvimento de componentes Convex"],"ru":["компоненты Convex","создание компонентов Convex","экспорт компонентов Convex","управление зависимостями Convex","документация Convex","повторно используемые компоненты","изоляция компонентов","разработка компонентов Convex","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["مكونات Convex","إنشاء مكونات Convex","تصدير مكونات Convex","إدارة التبعيات Convex","وثائق Convex","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","عزل المكونات","تنمية مكونات Convex","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"yspreen","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"yspreen/dotfiles","stars":33,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T02:50:45Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:38:26.492Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing reusable and isolatable Convex components for efficient project development.","zh":"适用于需要可重用和隔离的 Convex 组件以进行高效项目开发的全栈代理。","ja":"再利用可能で隔離されたConvexコンポーネントを必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트와 효율적인 프로젝트 개발을 위한 격리된 구성 요소를 필요로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan componentes Convex reutilizables e isolatables para un desarrollo de proyectos eficiente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de composants Convex réutilisables et isolés pour un développement de projet efficace.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die wiederverwendbare und isolierbare Convex-Komponenten für eine effiziente Projektentwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de componentes Convex reutilizáveis e isoláveis para desenvolvimento de projetos eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы многократно используемые и изолированные компоненты Convex для эффективной разработки проектов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومحززة لتنمية مشروع فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management using Convex''s component authoring features, enabling seamless sharing across projects and applications via https://docs.convex.dev/components and https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含的Convex组件的能力，具有适当的隔离、导出和依赖管理，使用Convex的组件作者功能，实现跨项目和应用程序的无缝共享，通过https://docs.convex.dev/components和https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring。","ja":"Convexのコンポーネントオーサリング機能を使用して、適切な隔離、エクスポート、および依存関係管理を備えたセルフコンテイニングConvexコンポーネントを作成できるエージェントを可能にし、https://docs.convex.dev/componentsおよびhttps://docs.convex.dev/components/authoringを介してプロジェクトやアプリケーション全体でシームレスに共有できます。","ko":"Convex의 컴포넌트 저작 기능을 사용하여 적절한 격리, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리를 갖춘 자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하여 https://docs.convex.dev/components 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring을 통해 프로젝트 및 애플리케이션 전반에 걸쳐 무중단으로 공유할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos con una adecuada isolación, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias utilizando las características de autoría de componentes de Convex, lo que permite una compartición sin problemas entre proyectos y aplicaciones a través de https://docs.convex.dev/components y https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus avec une isolation, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances appropriées en utilisant les fonctionnalités d''authoring de composants de Convex, ce qui permet un partage sans problème entre les projets et les applications via https://docs.convex.dev/components et https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, selbstenthaltene Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die Komponenten-Autorenfunktionen von Convex verwenden, was ein nahtloses Teilen zwischen Projekten und Anwendungen über https://docs.convex.dev/components und https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências usando os recursos de autorização de componentes do Convex, permitindo uma partilha sem problemas em todo o projeto e aplicações via https://docs.convex.dev/components e https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные компоненты Convex с надлежащей изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя возможности авторства компонентов Convex, что позволяет легко делиться ими между проектами и приложениями через https://docs.convex.dev/components и https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Convex خودية الحتواء مع العزل المناسب والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات باستخدام ميزات كتابة مكونات Convex، مما يسمح بمشاركتها بسهولة عبر المشاريع والتطبيقات عبر https://docs.convex.dev/components و https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating reusable UI components for multiple applications","Managing dependencies across shared Convex components","Exporting and importing Convex components for efficient project setup"],"zh":["为多个应用程序创建可重用的UI组件","管理共享Convex组件之间的依赖关系","导出和导入Convex组件以进行高效的项目设置"],"ja":["複数のアプリケーション用の再利用可能なUIコンポーネントの作成","共有Convexコンポーネント間の依存関係の管理","Convexコンポーネントのエクスポートおよびインポートによる効率的なプロジェクト設定"],"ko":["여러 애플리케이션용 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 생성","공유 Convex 컴포넌트 간 종속성 관리","Convex 컴포넌트 내보내기 및 가져오기를 통한 효율적인 프로젝트 설정"],"es":["Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables para múltiples aplicaciones","Gestionar dependencias entre componentes Convex compartidos","Exportar e importar componentes Convex para una configuración de proyecto eficiente"],"fr":["Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables pour plusieurs applications","Gérer les dépendances entre les composants Convex partagés","Exporter et importer des composants Convex pour une configuration de projet efficace"],"de":["Erstellen von wiederverwendbaren Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten für mehrere Anwendungen","Verwalten von Abhängigkeiten zwischen geteilten Convex-Komponenten","Exportieren und Importieren von Convex-Komponenten für eine effiziente Projekt-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Criar componentes de UI reutilizáveis para várias aplicações","Gerenciar dependências entre componentes Convex compartilhados","Exportar e importar componentes Convex para configuração de projeto eficiente"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов UI для нескольких приложений","Управление зависимостями между общими компонентами Convex","Экспорт и импорт компонентов Convex для эффективной настройки проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمجموعة من التطبيقات","إدارة التبعيات بين مكونات Convex المشتركة","تصدير واستيراد مكونات Convex من أجل إعداد مشروع فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex documentation access","Dependent on Convex''s component authoring capabilities","Needs proper understanding of Convex component isolation and dependency management"],"zh":["需要Convex文档访问权限","依赖于Convex的组件作者功能","需要正确理解Convex组件隔离和依赖管理"],"ja":["Convexドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convexのコンポーネントオーサリング機能に依存","Convexコンポーネントの隔離および依存関係管理についての適切な理解が必要"],"ko":["Convex 문서 액세스가 필요함","Convex의 컴포넌트 저작 기능에 종속됨","Convex 컴포넌트 격리 및 종속성 관리에 대한 올바른 이해가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de Convex","Depende de las capacidades de autoría de componentes de Convex","Necesita una comprensión adecuada de la isolación y la gestión de dependencias de componentes Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de Convex","Dépend des capacités d''authoring de composants de Convex","Nécessite une compréhension appropriée de l''isolation et de la gestion des dépendances des composants Convex"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Convex-Dokumentation","Hängt von den Komponenten-Autorenfunktionen von Convex ab","Benötigt ein ordnungsgemäßes Verständnis der Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung von Convex-Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do Convex","Depende das capacidades de autorização de componentes do Convex","Necessita de compreensão adequada do isolamento e gerenciamento de dependências de componentes Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации Convex","Зависит от возможностей авторства компонентов Convex","Требует надлежащего понимания изоляции и управления зависимостями компонентов Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق Convex","يعتمد على إمكانيات كتابة مكونات Convex","يحتاج إلى فهم مناسب للعزل وإدارة التبعيات لمكونات Convex"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"561346aded0969635fc3f32ae6d465f882266b6be20b4038c7a55645ff6db7c2","qualityScore":75}');
