Forks","Filtern nach Programmiersprache","Suche nach Themen und Lizenzen","Filtern nach Archivstatus","Suche in bestimmten Organisationen"],"pt":["Pesquisa por estrelas e bifurcações","Filtragem por linguagem de programação","Busca por tópicos e licenças","Filtragem por status de arquivamento","Pesquisa em organizações específicas"],"ru":["Поиск по звездам и вилкам","Фильтрация по языку программирования","Поиск по темам и лицензиям","Фильтрация по статусу архивации","Поиск в конкретных организациях"],"ar":["البحث بالنجوم والفروع","الترشيح حسب لغة البرمجة","البحث بالمواضيع والرخص","الترشيح حسب حالة الأرشفة","البحث في المنظمات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub仓库搜索","gh search repos","GitHub CLI","仓库过滤","星数过滤","语言过滤"],"ja":["GitHubリポジトリ検索","gh search repos","GitHub CLI","リポジトリフィルタリング","スター数フィルタリング","言語フィルタリング"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 검색","gh search repos","GitHub CLI","저장소 필터링","별 개수 필터링","언어 필터링"],"es":["búsqueda de repositorios github","gh search repos","repositorios de github","búsqueda de proyectos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de github"],"fr":["recherche de dépôts github","gh search repos","dépôts github","recherche de projets","développement de logiciels","outils github"],"de":["github-repository-suche","gh search repos","github-repositorys","projekt-suche","software-entwicklung","github-tools"],"pt":["gh search repos","pesquisa de repositórios github","github cli","repositórios populares","linguagem de programação","tópicos github"],"ru":["gh search repos","поиск репозиториев github","github cli","популярные репозитории","язык программирования","темы github"],"ar":["gh search repos","بحث المستودعات على github","واجهة سطر الأوامر github","المستودعات الشهيرة","لغة البرمجة","مواضيع github"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-search-repos","description":"Use when searching for repositories across GitHub - provides syntax for filtering by stars, forks, language, topics, license, archived status, and all repository attributes","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI: Search Repositories\n\n## Overview\n\nSearch for repositories **across GitHub** using `gh search repos`. Filter by stars, forks, language, topics, license, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when searching for repositories across GitHub:\n- Finding repositories by popularity (stars/forks)\n- Searching by programming language or topics\n- Finding repos with good first issues\n- Filtering by license or archived status\n- Searching in specific organizations or by owner\n- Need","body":"# GitHub CLI: Search Repositories\n\n## Overview\n\nSearch for repositories **across GitHub** using `gh search repos`. Filter by stars, forks, language, topics, license, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when searching for repositories across GitHub:\n- Finding repositories by popularity (stars/forks)\n- Searching by programming language or topics\n- Finding repos with good first issues\n- Filtering by license or archived status\n- Searching in specific organizations or by owner\n- Need to exclude certain results (requires `--` flag)\n\n## Syntax\n\n```bash\ngh search repos [<query>] [flags]\n```\n\n## Key Flags Reference\n\n### Repository Attributes\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `--language <string>` | Programming language | `--language python` |\n| `--topic <strings>` | Repository topics | `--topic machine-learning` |\n| `--license <strings>` | License type | `--license mit` |\n| `--archived {true\\|false}` | Archived state | `--archived false` |\n| `--owner <strings>` | Repository owner | `--owner github` |\n| `--visibility <string>` | Visibility: public, private, internal | `--visibility public` |\n\n### Popularity Metrics\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `--stars <number>` | Star count | `--stars \">1000\"` |\n| `--forks <number>` | Fork count | `--forks \">100\"` |\n| `--followers <number>` | Follower count | `--followers \">50\"` |\n| `--size <string>` | Size in KB | `--size \"100..1000\"` |\n\n### Issue Counts\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `--good-first-issues <number>` | \"Good first issue\" label count | `--good-first-issues \">=5\"` |\n| `--help-wanted-issues <number>` | \"Help wanted\" label count | `--help-wanted-issues \">=3\"` |\n\n### Date Filters\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `--created <date>` | Creation date | `--created \">2024-01-01\"` |\n| `--updated <date>` | Last update date | `--updated \">2024-06-01\"` |\n\n### Search Scope\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `--match <strings>` | Search in: name, description, readme | `--match name` |\n| `--include-forks {false\\|true\\|only}` | Include/exclude forks | `--include-forks false` |\n\n### Output & Sorting\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `-L, --limit <int>` | Max results (default: 30) | `--limit 100` |\n| `--sort <string>` | Sort by: stars, forks, updated, etc. | `--sort stars` |\n| `--order <string>` | Sort direction: asc or desc | `--order desc` |\n| `--json <fields>` | JSON output | `--json name,stargazersCount,language` |\n| `-w, --web` | Open in browser | `-w` |\n\n## JSON Output Fields\n\n`createdAt`, `defaultBranch`, `description`, `forksCount`, `fullName`, `hasDownloads`, `hasIssues`, `hasPages`, `hasProjects`, `hasWiki`, `homepage`, `id`, `isArchived`, `isDisabled`, `isFork`, `isPrivate`, `language`, `license`, `name`, `openIssuesCount`, `owner`, `pushedAt`, `size`, `stargazersCount`, `updatedAt`, `url`, `visibility`, `watchersCount`\n\n## Exclusion Syntax (Critical!)\n\nWhen using inline query exclusions (negations with `-`), you MUST use the `--` separator:\n\n✅ Correct: `gh search repos -- \"search-terms -qualifier:value\"`\n❌ Wrong: `gh search repos \"search-terms\" --flag=-value`\n❌ Wrong: `gh search repos \"search-terms\" --flag=!value`\n❌ Wrong: `gh search repos --language=-Go`\n\n**Examples:**\n- `gh search repos -- \"cli -language:go\"` (exclude language)\n- `gh search repos -- \"starter -archived:true\"` (exclude archived)\n- `gh search repos -- \"web -topic:deprecated\"` (exclude topic)\n- `gh search repos -- \"library -license:gpl-3.0\"` (exclude license)\n\n**Why the `--` separator is required:**\nThe `--` tells the shell to stop parsing flags and treat everything after it as arguments. Without it, `-qualifier:value` inside quotes may be misinterpreted.\n\n## Critical Syntax Rules\n\n### When to Use Flag Syntax vs Query Syntax\n\n**Decision Tree:**\n```\nDoes your search include:\n  - Any exclusions (NOT, minus, without, except)?  → Use Query Syntax with `--`\n  - Complex boolean logic (OR, AND)?              → Use Query Syntax with `--`\n\nOtherwise:\n  - Simple positive filters only?                  → Use Flag Syntax\n```\n\n**Flag Syntax** (for positive filters):\n```bash\ngh search repos \"cli\" --language go --stars \">100\"\n```\n\n**Query Syntax with `--`** (required for exclusions):\n```bash\ngh search repos -- \"cli -language:javascript -archived:true\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ NEVER mix both syntaxes in a single command!**\n\n### 1. Exclusions and Negations\n\n**CRITICAL:** When excluding results, you MUST use query syntax with the `--` separator.\n\n#### Exclusion Syntax Rules:\n1. Use the `--` separator before your query\n2. Use `-qualifier:value` format (dash prefix for negation)\n3. Quote the entire query string\n\n#### Examples:\n\n**Single exclusion:**\n```bash\n# Exclude specific language\ngh search repos -- \"web framework -language:javascript\"\n\n# Exclude archived repos\ngh search repos -- \"cli tool -archived:true\"\n```\n\n**Multiple exclusions:**\n```bash\n# Exclude multiple languages\ngh search repos -- \"game engine -language:javascript -language:python\"\n\n# Exclude archived and small repos\ngh search repos -- \"starter -archived:true -stars:<10\"\n```\n\n**Combine with positive filters using flags:**\n```bash\n# Wrong - mixing syntaxes:\ngh search repos \"cli\" --language go -archived:true  # ❌\n\n# Correct - use query syntax for everything when excluding:\ngh search repos -- \"cli language:go -archived:true\"  # ✅\n```\n\n**PowerShell exclusions:**\n```powershell\n# Use --% to prevent PowerShell parsing\ngh --% search repos -- \"cli -language:javascript\"\n```\n\n#### Common Exclusion Patterns:\n\n| User Request | Command |\n|--------------|---------|\n| \"Find repos but not archived\" | `gh search repos -- \"starter -archived:true\"` |\n| \"Repos excluding specific language\" | `gh search repos -- \"web framework -language:php\"` |\n| \"Repos not in specific topic\" | `gh search repos -- \"cli -topic:deprecated\"` |\n| \"Repos excluding multiple languages\" | `gh search repos -- \"game -language:javascript -language:css\"` |\n| \"Repos not forks\" | `gh search repos -- \"template -is:fork\"` (or use `--include-forks false`) |\n| \"Repos excluding low stars\" | `gh search repos -- \"framework -stars:<100\"` |\n| \"Repos not with specific license\" | `gh search repos -- \"library -license:gpl-3.0\"` |\n\n### 2. Special Values\n\n- Multiple topics: `--topic unix,terminal`\n- Boolean flags: `--archived false` or `--archived true`\n- Fork inclusion: `--include-forks false|true|only`\n\n### 3. Quoting Rules\n\n**Multi-word search:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"machine learning\"\n```\n\n**Comparison operators need quotes:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"python\" --stars \">1000\"\n```\n\n**Ranges use quotes:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"cli\" --stars \"100..500\"\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n**Find popular Python repos:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"data science\" --language python --stars \">5000\"\n```\n\n**Find repos with good first issues:**\n```bash\ngh search repos --language javascript --good-first-issues \">=10\"\n```\n\n**Find recently updated repos:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react\" --updated \">2024-01-01\" --stars \">100\"\n```\n\n**Find repos by topic:**\n```bash\ngh search repos --topic machine-learning --language python\n```\n\n**Find repos by license:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"web framework\" --license mit,apache-2.0\n```\n\n**Exclude archived repos:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"cli tool\" --archived false\n```\n\n**Find repos by organization:**\n```bash\ngh search repos --owner microsoft --visibility public\n```\n\n**Exclude forks:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"starter\" --include-forks false\n```\n\n**Find only forks:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"template\" --include-forks only\n```\n\n**Find repos in star range:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"game engine\" --stars \"100..1000\"\n```\n\n**Exclude specific language:**\n```bash\ngh search repos -- \"cli -language:go\"\n```\n\n**Search in name only:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"awesome\" --match name\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Problem | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| `--language=\"NOT javascript\"` or `--archived=-true` | Flag syntax doesn''t support negation | Use query: `-- \"-language:javascript\"` or `-- \"-archived:true\"` |\n| `gh search repos cli -language:js` | `-language` interpreted as flag | Use `--`: `-- \"cli -language:js\"` |\n| `\"cli NOT language:js\"` | `NOT` keyword doesn''t work | Use `-`: `-- \"cli -language:js\"` |\n| Mixing syntaxes: `--stars \">100\" \"cli -language:js\"` | Can''t mix flags with query qualifiers | Use query for all: `-- \"cli stars:>100 -language:js\"` |\n| Not quoting comparisons | Shell interprets `>` | Quote: `--stars \">1000\"` |\n| `--archived archived` | Invalid value | Use boolean: `--archived true` or `false` |\n| Not quoting multi-word search | Searches separately | Quote: `\"machine learning\"` |\n| Using `@` with owner | Invalid syntax | Drop `@`: `--owner github` |\n| PowerShell without `--%` | Breaks with exclusions | Add: `gh --%` |\n\n## Installation Check\n\nIf `gh` command not found:\n```bash\n# Check if gh is installed\nwhich gh\n\n# Install: https://cli.github.com/manual/installation\n```\n\nIf not authenticated:\n```bash\n# Authenticate with GitHub\ngh auth login\n```\n\n## Comparison Operators\n\n- `>` - Greater than\n- `>=` - Greater than or equal\n- `<` - Less than\n- `<=` - Less than or equal\n- `..` - Range: `100..1000` or `2024-01-01..2024-12-31`\n\n## Common Licenses\n\n- `mit` - MIT License\n- `apache-2.0` - Apache License 2.0\n- `gpl-3.0` - GNU GPL v3\n- `bsd-2-clause` - BSD 2-Clause\n- `bsd-3-clause` - BSD 3-Clause\n- `mpl-2.0` - Mozilla Public License 2.0\n- `isc` - ISC License\n\n## Match Field Options\n\n- `name` - Search repository names only\n- `description` - Search descriptions only\n- `readme` - Search README files only\n\nExample: `gh search repos \"documentation\" --match readme`\n\n## Related\n\n- GitHub search syntax: https://docs.github.com/search-github/searching-on-github/searching-for-repositories\n- For searching other resources: `gh-search-code`, `gh-search-commits`, `gh-search-issues`, `gh-search-prs`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:17:52.676Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents seeking to streamline GitHub repository discovery and filtering by stars, forks, language, and topics.","zh":"适合开发者代理寻求简化 GitHub 仓库发现和筛选的功能，按照星数、分叉、语言和主题进行筛选。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの検出と、スター、フォーク、言語、トピックによるフィルタリングを効率化したい開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스타, 포크, 언어, 주제별 GitHub 리포지토리 검색 및 필터링을 간소화하려는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que buscan optimizar la detección y filtrado de repositorios de GitHub por estrellas, bifurcaciones, idioma y temas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement souhaitant rationaliser la découverte et le filtrage des référentiels GitHub par étoiles, fourches, langage et sujets.","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die die Erkennung und Filterung von GitHub-Repositorys nach Sternen, Forks, Sprache und Themen optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que buscam otimizar a descoberta e filtragem de repositórios GitHub por estrelas, bifurcações, linguagem e tópicos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, стремящихся оптимизировать обнаружение и фильтрацию репозиториев GitHub по звездам, вилкам, языку и темам.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يرغبون في تسهيل اكتشاف واستخراج مستودعات GitHub بواسطة نجوم ، فوركس ، لغة ، ومواضيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to search across GitHub using gh search repos, filtering by criteria like programming language, topics, license, and archived status, and leveraging GitHub CLI for efficient repository discovery.","zh":"赋予代理搜索 GitHub 的能力，使用 gh search repos，按照标准如编程语言、主题、许可证和归档状态进行筛选，并利用 GitHub CLI 实现高效的仓库发现。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub を検索する機能を提供し、gh search repos を使用して、プログラミング言語、トピック、ライセンス、またはアーカイブ化の状態などの基準でフィルタリングを行い、GitHub CLI を使用して効率的なリポジトリの検出を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub를 검색할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, gh search repos를 사용하여 프로그래밍 언어, 주제, 라이선스 또는 보관 상태와 같은 기준으로 필터링을 수행하며, GitHub CLI를 사용하여 효율적인 리포지토리 검색을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes buscar en GitHub mediante gh search repos, filtrando por criterios como lenguaje de programación, temas, licencia y estado archivado, y aprovechando GitHub CLI para una descubierta eficiente de repositorios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher sur GitHub à l''aide de gh search repos, en filtrant par des critères tels que le langage de programmation, les sujets, la licence et le statut archivé, et en exploitant GitHub CLI pour une découverte efficace de référentiels.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mit gh search repos in GitHub zu suchen, gefiltert nach Kriterien wie Programmiersprache, Themen, Lizenz und Archivstatus, und nutzt GitHub CLI für eine effiziente Repository-Erkennung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes pesquisem em todo o GitHub usando gh search repos, filtrando por critérios como linguagem de programação, tópicos, licença e status arquivado, e aproveitando o GitHub CLI para descoberta eficiente de repositórios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью искать по всему GitHub с помощью gh search repos, фильтруя по критериям, таким как язык программирования, темы, лицензия и архивный статус, и использует GitHub CLI для эффективного обнаружения репозиториев.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بالبحث عبر GitHub باستخدام gh search repos ، وتصفية النتائج حسب معايير مثل لغة البرمجة ، والمواضيع ، والترخيص ، وحالة الأرشفة ، وتحقيق واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub لاكتشاف المستودعات بكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching for popular repositories by stars or forks","Filtering repositories by specific programming languages or topics","Identifying repositories with good first issues for contributor engagement","Discovering repositories under specific licenses or ownership"],"zh":["按星数或分叉搜索热门仓库","按特定编程语言或主题筛选仓库","识别具有良好首次问题的仓库以提高贡献者参与度","发现特定许可或所有权的仓库"],"ja":["スターまたはフォークによる人気リポジトリの検索","特定のプログラミング言語やトピックによるリポジトリのフィルタリング","貢献者エンゲージメントのための良い最初の問題を持つリポジトリの識別","特定のライセンスまたは所有権のリポジトリの発見"],"ko":["스타 또는 포크로 인기 리포지토리를 검색","특정 프로그래밍 언어 또는 주제로 리포지토리를 필터링","기여자 참여를 위한 좋은 첫 번째 문제가 있는 리포지토리를 식별","특정 라이선스 또는 소유권의 리포지토리를 발견"],"es":["Buscar repositorios populares por estrellas o bifurcaciones","Filtrar repositorios por lenguajes de programación o temas específicos","Identificar repositorios con buenos problemas de inicio para la participación de contribuyentes","Descubrir repositorios bajo licencias o propiedad específicas"],"fr":["Rechercher des référentiels populaires par étoiles ou fourches","Filtrer des référentiels par langages de programmation ou sujets spécifiques","Identifier des référentiels avec de bons problèmes de début pour l''engagement des contributeurs","Découvrir des référentiels sous des licences ou une propriété spécifiques"],"de":["Nach beliebten Repositorys nach Sternen oder Forks suchen","Repositorys nach bestimmten Programmiersprachen oder Themen filtern","Repositorys mit guten ersten Problemen für die Einbindung von Mitwirkenden identifizieren","Repositorys unter bestimmten Lizenzen oder Eigentumsverhältnissen entdecken"],"pt":["Pesquisar repositórios populares por estrelas ou bifurcações","Filtrar repositórios por linguagens de programação específicas ou tópicos","Identificar repositórios com boas questões iniciais para engajamento de contribuidores","Descobrir repositórios sob licenças ou propriedade específicas"],"ru":["Поиск популярных репозиториев по звездам или вилкам","Фильтрация репозиториев по конкретным языкам программирования или темам","Определение репозиториев с хорошими первыми vấnами для участия вкладчиков","Обнаружение репозиториев под конкретными лицензиями или владением"],"ar":["البحث عن مستودعات شائعة حسب النجوم أو الفوركس","تصفية المستودعات حسب لغات برمجة محددة أو مواضيع","تحديد المستودعات التي تحتوي على قضايا جيدة للبدء من أجل تعزيز المشاركة","اكتشاف المستودعات الخاضعة للتراخيص أو الملكية المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation and configuration","Dependent on GitHub API and rate limits"],"zh":["需要安装和配置 GitHub CLI","依赖于 GitHub API 和速率限制"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールと構成が必要","GitHub API とレート制限に依存"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요","GitHub API 및 속도 제한에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de GitHub CLI","Depende de la API de GitHub y los límites de velocidad"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de GitHub CLI","Dépend de l''API GitHub et des limites de débit"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von GitHub CLI","Hängt von der GitHub-API und den Raten ab"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do GitHub CLI","Dependente da API do GitHub e limites de taxa"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки GitHub CLI","Зависит от GitHub API и ограничений скорости"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub","يعتمد على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub وحدود السعر"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"24d3f37198ce466d27c8632ed4f6ad9bd50cb444d87d039bded40883fb6be7a7","qualityScore":75}');
