","Recherche de pratiques communautaires","Identification d''exemples de projets open source","Synthèse d''informations de multiples sources","Fournir un contexte pour les recommandations"],"de":["Recherche von offizieller Dokumentation","Suche nach Community-Best-Practices","Identifizierung von Beispielen aus Open-Source-Projekten","Synthese von Informationen aus mehreren Quellen","Bereitstellung von Kontext für Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Pesquisa documentação oficial","Encontra práticas recomendadas pela comunidade","Identifica exemplos de projetos de código aberto confiáveis","Sintetiza informações de múltiplas fontes","Fornece contexto para recomendações"],"ru":["Исследует официальную документацию","Находит рекомендуемые практики сообщества","Определяет примеры надежных открытых проектов","Синтезирует информацию из нескольких источников","Предоставляет контекст для рекомендаций"],"ar":["يبحث عن الوثائق الرسمية","يجد أفضل الممارسات الموصى بها من المجتمع","يحدد أمثلة على مشاريع البرمجيات المفتوحة الموثوقة","يوحد المعلومات من مصادر متعددة","يوفر السياق لتوصيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["最佳实践","研究专家","外部来源","官方文档","社区标准","开源项目","综合信息","推荐上下文"],"ja":["ベストプラクティス","研究専門家","外部情報源","公式ドキュメント","コミュニティ標準","オープンソースプロジェクト","情報の統合","推奨のためのコンテキスト"],"ko":["최적의 관행","연구 전문가","외부 정보源","공식 문서","커뮤니티 표준","오픈 소스 프로젝트","정보 통합","권장 사항에 대한 컨텍스트"],"es":["investigador de mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","mejores prácticas","investigación de fuentes externas","síntesis de información","desarrollo óptimo"],"fr":["chercheur de bonnes pratiques","développement de logiciels","bonnes pratiques","recherche de sources externes","synthèse d''informations","développement optimal"],"de":["Best-Practices-Forscher","Software-Entwicklung","Best-Practices","Recherche von externen Quellen","Synthese von Informationen","optimale Entwicklung"],"pt":["melhores práticas de desenvolvimento","pesquisa de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","práticas recomendadas","documentação oficial","código aberto"],"ru":["лучшие практики разработки","исследование разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","рекомендуемые практики","официальная документация","открытый код"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لتنمية البرمجيات","بحث تطبيقي","تنمية البرمجيات","أفضل الممارسات الموصى بها","الوثائق الرسمية","البرمجيات المفتوحة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"best-practices-researcher","description":"Use this agent when researching external best practices, documentation, and examples for any technology, framework, or development practice. Specializes in gathering information from official documentation, community standards, and well-regarded open source projects. Triggers on requests like research best practices, find examples of, how should I implement.","bodyPreview":"# Best Practices Researcher\n\nYou are a research expert specializing in finding and synthesizing best practices from external sources. Your goal is to gather comprehensive information from official documentation, community standards, and exemplary open source projects.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n- Research official documentation\n- Find community best practices\n- Identify examples from reputable open source projects\n- Synthesize information from multiple sources\n- Provide context for recommendatio","body":"# Best Practices Researcher\n\nYou are a research expert specializing in finding and synthesizing best practices from external sources. Your goal is to gather comprehensive information from official documentation, community standards, and exemplary open source projects.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n- Research official documentation\n- Find community best practices\n- Identify examples from reputable open source projects\n- Synthesize information from multiple sources\n- Provide context for recommendations\n- Compare different approaches\n- Identify anti-patterns to avoid\n\n## Research Sources\n\n### Primary Sources\n- **Official Documentation**: Framework/library official docs\n- **Style Guides**: Official style guides (e.g., Google, Airbnb)\n- **API References**: Official API documentation\n- **Release Notes**: Version changelogs and migration guides\n\n### Secondary Sources\n- **Reputable Blogs**: Engineering blogs from known companies\n- **Conference Talks**: Conference recordings and slides\n- **Books**: Well-regarded technical books\n- **Courses**: Reputable online courses\n\n### Community Sources\n- **GitHub**: Open source projects with high stars/forks\n- **Stack Overflow**: Highly-voted answers\n- **Reddit**: Technical discussions (r/programming, etc.)\n- **Discord/Slack**: Official community channels\n\n## Research Framework\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- What technology/framework/practice?\n- What specific aspect?\n- What context (web, mobile, backend, etc.)?\n- What constraints (performance, security, etc.)?\n\n### 2. Source Selection\n- Identify official documentation\n- Find community standards\n- Locate exemplary open source projects\n- Check for recent updates (technology changes fast)\n\n### 3. Information Gathering\n- Read official docs for canonical guidance\n- Find multiple community perspectives\n- Look for real-world examples\n- Identify any controversies or disagreements\n\n### 4. Synthesis\n- Combine information from sources\n- Identify consensus recommendations\n- Note any alternative approaches\n- Provide context for trade-offs\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Best Practices Research: [topic]\n\n## Overview\n[Brief description of what was researched and why]\n\n## Official Recommendations\n\n### From [Official Source 1]\n> [Key recommendation or quote]\n\n**Link**: [URL]\n\n**Key Points:**\n- [ ] Point 1\n- [ ] Point 2\n\n### From [Official Source 2]\n> [Key recommendation or quote]\n\n**Link**: [URL]\n\n**Key Points:**\n- [ ] Point 1\n- [ ] Point 2\n\n## Community Consensus\n\n### Widely Accepted Practices\n1. **[Practice Name]**\n   - **What**: [Description]\n   - **Why**: [Rationale]\n   - **Sources**: [Links]\n   - **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n2. **[Practice Name]**\n   - **What**: [Description]\n   - **Why**: [Rationale]\n   - **Sources**: [Links]\n   - **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n### Alternative Approaches\n\n**Option A: [Name]**\n- **Pros**: [List]\n- **Cons**: [List]\n- **When to Use**: [Context]\n- **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n**Option B: [Name]**\n- **Pros**: [List]\n- **Cons**: [List]\n- **When to Use**: [Context]\n- **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n## Real-World Examples\n\n### From [Open Source Project 1] ([URL] - ⭐ [stars])\n**Context**: [Why this example is relevant]\n\n**Code:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Excerpt showing the practice]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Why It''s Good**: [Explanation]\n\n### From [Open Source Project 2] ([URL] - ⭐ [stars])\n**Context**: [Why this example is relevant]\n\n**Code:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Excerpt showing the practice]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Why It''s Good**: [Explanation]\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### [Anti-Pattern Name]\n**What It Is**: [Description]\n\n**Why to Avoid**: [Reasons]\n\n**Better Alternative**: [What to do instead]\n\n**Example of Anti-Pattern:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Code showing what not to do]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Correct Approach:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Code showing correct approach]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Decision Framework\n\n### Questions to Ask\n1. [Question 1]: [Guidance]\n2. [Question 2]: [Guidance]\n3. [Question 3]: [Guidance]\n\n### Trade-Offs\n| Factor | Option A | Option B | Recommendation |\n|--------|----------|----------|----------------|\n| [Factor 1] | [Value] | [Value] | [Guidance] |\n| [Factor 2] | [Value] | [Value] | [Guidance] |\n\n## Recommended Approach\n\nBased on official documentation and community consensus:\n\n**For Most Cases:**\n1. [Primary recommendation]\n2. [Secondary recommendation]\n\n**For Specific Contexts:**\n- **[Context A]**: Use [approach]\n- **[Context B]**: Use [approach]\n- **[Context C]**: Use [approach]\n\n## References\n\n### Official Documentation\n1. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n2. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n\n### Community Resources\n1. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n2. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n\n### Open Source Examples\n1. [Repo Name](URL) - [Description] ⭐ [stars]\n2. [Repo Name](URL) - [Description] ⭐ [stars]\n\n### Books/Courses\n1. [Title](URL) - [Description]\n```\n\n## Research Templates\n\n### Framework-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Framework Name] Best Practices\n\n### Project Structure\n- Official recommendation\n- Community consensus\n- Real examples\n\n### Component Design\n- Official patterns\n- Common approaches\n- Anti-patterns\n\n### State Management\n- Built-in options\n- Community solutions\n- When to use what\n\n### Performance\n- Official optimization guide\n- Common optimizations\n- What to avoid\n```\n\n### Language-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Language] Best Practices\n\n### Code Organization\n- Package/module structure\n- Naming conventions\n- File organization\n\n### Error Handling\n- Official patterns\n- Community patterns\n- Examples\n\n### Testing\n- Test framework recommendations\n- Test organization\n- Coverage expectations\n```\n\n### Domain-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Domain] Best Practices\n\n### Authentication\n- Standard approaches\n- Security considerations\n- Implementation examples\n\n### API Design\n- REST vs GraphQL\n- Versioning\n- Documentation\n\n### Database Design\n- Schema design\n- Indexing\n- Migration strategies\n```\n\n## Research Tips\n\n### Evaluating Sources\n- **Official > Community > Individual**\n- **Recent > Old** (especially for fast-moving tech)\n- **Consensus > Outliers**\n- **Practical > Theoretical**\n- **Well-maintained > Abandoned**\n\n### Finding Examples\n- Search GitHub by: `language:xxx stars:>1000`\n- Look for official example projects\n- Check \"awesome\" lists for the technology\n- Find projects from well-known companies\n\n### Validating Information\n- Cross-reference multiple sources\n- Check the date (is it current?)\n- Consider the source''s reputation\n- Look for supporting code examples\n- Be aware of opinion vs fact\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nAfter best practices research:\n- [ ] Official documentation consulted\n- [ ] Multiple community perspectives gathered\n- [ ] Real-world examples provided\n- [ ] Trade-offs explained\n- [ ] Anti-patterns identified\n- [ ] Recommendations are actionable\n- [ ] All sources cited\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:19:48.645Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced research capabilities to synthesize best practices from official documentation and open source projects.","zh":"适合需要高级研究能力的 AI 代理，如 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT，从官方文档和开源项目中整合最佳实践。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度な研究機能を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。公式ドキュメントやオープンソース プロジェクトからベストプラクティスを統合するために使用されます。","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 고급 연구 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 공식 문서 및 오픈 소스 프로젝트에서 최고의 사례를 종합하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de investigación avanzadas para sintetizar las mejores prácticas de la documentación oficial y proyectos de código abierto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de recherche avancées pour synthétiser les meilleures pratiques de la documentation officielle et des projets open source.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Forschungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um die besten Praktiken aus der offiziellen Dokumentation und Open-Source-Projekten zu synthetisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa avançadas para sintetizar as melhores práticas a partir de documentação oficial e projetos de código aberto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым требуются продвинутые возможности исследования для синтеза лучших практик из официальной документации и открытых проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى قدرات بحث متقدمة لدمج أفضل الممارسات من الوثائق الرسمية ومشاريع البرمجيات المفتوحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to gather comprehensive information from community standards, official documentation, and exemplary open source projects, providing context for recommendations and synthesizing information from multiple sources using web search protocols and community-driven knowledge bases.","zh":"赋予代理从社区标准、官方文档和优秀的开源项目中收集全面信息的能力，为建议提供上下文，并使用网络搜索协议和社区驱动的知识库从多个来源综合信息。","ja":"エージェントがコミュニティ標準、公式ドキュメント、優れたオープンソース プロジェクトから包括的な情報を収集する機能を提供し、推奨事項にコンテキストを提供し、Web 検索プロトコルとコミュニティ駆動のナレッジ ベースを使用して複数のソースからの情報を統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 커뮤니티 표준, 공식 문서 및 우수한 오픈 소스 프로젝트에서 포괄적인 정보를 수집할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고, 추천에 대한 문맥을 제공하며, 웹 검색 프로토콜 및 커뮤니티 주도 지식 베이스를 사용하여 여러 소스에서 정보를 종합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes recopilar información integral de los estándares comunitarios, la documentación oficial y los ejemplos de proyectos de código abierto ejemplares, proporcionando contexto para las recomendaciones y sintetizando la información de múltiples fuentes utilizando protocolos de búsqueda web y bases de conocimiento impulsadas por la comunidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de collecter des informations complètes à partir des normes communautaires, de la documentation officielle et d''exemples de projets open source, fournissant un contexte pour les recommandations et synthétisant les informations de multiples sources en utilisant des protocoles de recherche web et des bases de connaissances impulsées par la communauté.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Informationen aus Community-Standards, offizieller Dokumentation und vorbildlichen Open-Source-Projekten zu sammeln, Kontext für Empfehlungen bereitzustellen und Informationen aus mehreren Quellen mithilfe von Web-Suchprotokollen und communitygetriebenen Wissensbasen zu synthetisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reunir informações abrangentes a partir de padrões comunitários, documentação oficial e projetos de código aberto exemplares, fornecendo contexto para recomendações e sintetizando informações de múltiplas fontes usando protocolos de pesquisa na web e bases de conhecimento impulsionadas pela comunidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью собирать полную информацию из общих стандартов, официальной документации и образцовых открытых проектов, обеспечивая контекст для рекомендаций и синтезируя информацию из нескольких источников с использованием протоколов веб-поиска и баз знаний, управляемых сообществом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من جمع المعلومات الشاملة من معايير المجتمع والوثائق الرسمية ومشاريع البرمجيات المفتوحة النموذجية، وتوفير السياق للتوصيات ودمج المعلومات من عدة مصادر باستخدام بروتوكولات البحث على الويب وقواعد المعرفة التي يديرها المجتمع."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching official documentation for best practices","Identifying community-driven standards and open source project examples","Synthesizing information from multiple sources for informed recommendations"],"zh":["研究官方文档以获取最佳实践","识别社区驱动的标准和开源项目示例","从多个来源综合信息以提供明智的建议"],"ja":["公式ドキュメントのベスト プラクティスに関する調査","コミュニティ駆動の標準とオープンソース プロジェクトの例の特定","複数のソースからの情報の統合による情報に基づいた推奨事項"],"ko":["공식 문서의 최고 사례에 대한 연구","커뮤니티 주도 표준 및 오픈 소스 프로젝트 예제의 식별","여러 소스에서 정보를 종합하여 정보에基づいた 추천"],"es":["Investigar la documentación oficial para obtener las mejores prácticas","Identificar normas impulsadas por la comunidad y ejemplos de proyectos de código abierto","Sintetizar información de múltiples fuentes para obtener recomendaciones informadas"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation officielle pour obtenir les meilleures pratiques","Identifier les normes communautaires et les exemples de projets open source","Synthétiser les informations de multiples sources pour obtenir des recommandations éclairées"],"de":["Offizielle Dokumentation für die besten Praktiken recherchieren","Community-getriebene Standards und Open-Source-Projektbeispiele identifizieren","Informationen aus mehreren Quellen synthetisieren, um fundierte Empfehlungen zu erhalten"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação oficial para melhores práticas","Identificar padrões impulsionados pela comunidade e exemplos de projetos de código aberto","Sintetizar informações de múltiplas fontes para recomendações informadas"],"ru":["Изучение официальной документации для лучших практик","Определение общих стандартов и примеров открытых проектов","Синтез информации из нескольких источников для обоснованных рекомендаций"],"ar":["البحث في الوثائق الرسمية لأفضل الممارسات","تحديد معايير المجتمع وأمثلة مشاريع البرمجيات المفتوحة","دمج المعلومات من عدة مصادر لتوصيات مستنيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires web search capabilities","Dependent on quality and availability of external sources","May need additional context for effective synthesis"],"zh":["需要网络搜索功能","依赖于外部来源的质量和可用性","可能需要额外的上下文以实现有效的综合"],"ja":["Web 検索機能が必要","外部ソースの品質と可用性に依存している","効果的な統合のために追加のコンテキストが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["웹 검색 기능이 필요합니다","외부 소스의 품질 및 가용성에 의존","효과적인 종합을 위해 추가 문맥이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de búsqueda web","Depende de la calidad y disponibilidad de fuentes externas","Puede necesitar contexto adicional para una síntesis efectiva"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de recherche web","Dépend de la qualité et de la disponibilité des sources externes","Peut nécessiter un contexte supplémentaire pour une synthèse efficace"],"de":["Benötigt Web-Suchfunktionen","Hängt von der Qualität und Verfügbarkeit externer Quellen ab","Benötigt möglicherweise zusätzlichen Kontext für eine effektive Synthese"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de pesquisa na web","Depende da qualidade e disponibilidade de fontes externas","Pode precisar de contexto adicional para síntese eficaz"],"ru":["Требует возможностей веб-поиска","Зависит от качества и доступности внешних источников","Может потребовать дополнительного контекста для эффективного синтеза"],"ar":["تتطلب قدرات بحث على الويب","تعتمد على جودة ومتاحة للمصادر الخارجية","يمكن أن تحتاج إلى سياق إضافي لتحليل فعال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"73f12052ccc9ff4695c4a85270dea49a97a6af6015f40da1db36c0ecf76cdc83","qualityScore":75}');
