atibilité avec les espaces et les caractères spéciaux"],"de":["Suche nach Problemen und PRs","Suche nach Repos und Code","Suche nach Commits","Verwendung von Befehlen mit Ausschlüssen","Verwendung von Befehlen mit mehreren Qualifizierern","Kompatibilität mit Leerzeichen und Sonderzeichen"],"pt":["Pesquisa de issues e PRs","Pesquisa de repositórios e código","Suporte a consultas com exclusões","Suporte a consultas com múltiplos qualificadores","Suporte a consultas com espaços ou caracteres especiais"],"ru":["Поиск вопросов и PR","Поиск репозиториев и кода","Поддержка запросов с исключениями","Поддержка запросов с несколькими квалификаторами","Поддержка запросов с пробелами или специальными символами"],"ar":["بحث القضايا وطلبات السحب","بحث المخازن والكود","دعم الاستفسارات التي تحتوي على استثناءات","دعم الاستفسارات التي تحتوي على مؤهلات متعددة","دعم الاستفسارات التي تحتوي على مسافات أو رموز خاصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub","命令行搜索","gh search","复杂查询","排除","开发工具"],"ja":["GitHub","CLI 検索","gh search","複雑なクエリ","除外","開発ツール"],"ko":["GitHub","명령줄 검색","gh search","복잡한 쿼리","제외","개발 도구"],"es":["búsqueda de GitHub","gh search","línea de comandos","issues","PRs","repos","código","commits","exclusiones"],"fr":["recherche GitHub","gh search","ligne de commande","problèmes","PR","dépôts","code","commits","exclusions"],"de":["GitHub-Suche","gh search","Kommandozeile","Probleme","PRs","Repos","Code","Commits","Ausschlüsse"],"pt":["github cli","gh search","pesquisa github","github issues","github prs","github repositórios","github código"],"ru":["github cli","gh search","поиск github","github вопросы","github pr","github репозитории","github код"],"ar":["جيت هاب سي إل آي","غه سيرش","بحث جيت هاب","قضايا جيت هاب","طلبات سحب جيت هاب","مخازن جيت هاب","كود جيت هاب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-search","description":"Use when searching GitHub via CLI for issues, PRs, repos, code, or commits - provides correct syntax for exclusions, qualifiers, quoting, and platform-specific handling to avoid command failures","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Search\n\n## Overview\n\nSearch GitHub from the command line using `gh search` subcommands. The key principle: **Always use `--` before queries with exclusions** to prevent shell interpretation of `-` prefixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Searching GitHub via `gh` CLI for issues, PRs, repos, code, or commits\n- User requests searches with exclusions (NOT, minus prefix)\n- Constructing complex queries with multiple qualifiers\n- Queries contain spaces or special characters\n\n## S","body":"# GitHub CLI Search\n\n## Overview\n\nSearch GitHub from the command line using `gh search` subcommands. The key principle: **Always use `--` before queries with exclusions** to prevent shell interpretation of `-` prefixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Searching GitHub via `gh` CLI for issues, PRs, repos, code, or commits\n- User requests searches with exclusions (NOT, minus prefix)\n- Constructing complex queries with multiple qualifiers\n- Queries contain spaces or special characters\n\n## Subcommands Quick Reference\n\n| Subcommand | Use For | Common Flags |\n|------------|---------|--------------|\n| `gh search issues` | Issues (add `--include-prs` for PRs too) | `--label`, `--state`, `--author`, `--assignee` |\n| `gh search prs` | Pull requests only | `--label`, `--state`, `--author`, `--draft`, `--merged` |\n| `gh search repos` | Repositories | `--language`, `--stars`, `--topic`, `--owner` |\n| `gh search code` | Code within files | `--repo`, `--language`, `--filename` |\n| `gh search commits` | Commit messages | `--repo`, `--author`, `--committer` |\n\n## Critical Syntax Rules\n\n### 1. Exclusions Require `--` Flag\n\n**Unix/Linux/Mac:**\n```bash\ngh search issues -- \"bug -label:duplicate\"\n```\n\n**PowerShell:**\n```powershell\ngh --% search issues -- \"bug -label:duplicate\"\n```\n\n**Why:** The `-` prefix gets interpreted as a command flag without `--`. PowerShell needs `--% ` to stop parsing.\n\n### 2. Quoting Rules\n\n**Multi-word queries need quotes:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"memory leak\"\n```\n\n**Entire query with spaces should be quoted:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug label:urgent created:>2024-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Qualifier values with spaces need inner quotes:**\n```bash\ngh search prs -- ''security label:\"bug fix\"''\n```\n\n### 3. Qualifier Syntax\n\n**Inline qualifiers** (use within search query):\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react stars:>1000 language:typescript\"\n```\n\n**Flag-based** (use as separate flags):\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react\" --language typescript --stars \">1000\"\n```\n\n**Can mix both:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"crash\" --label bug created:>2024-01-01\n```\n\n## Common Qualifiers\n\n### Comparison Operators\n- `>`, `>=`, `<`, `<=` - Numeric: `stars:>100`, `comments:>=5`\n- `..` - Ranges: `stars:10..50`, `created:2024-01-01..2024-12-31`\n\n### Special Values\n- `@me` - Current user: `author:@me`, `assignee:@me`, `owner:@me`\n- Dates use ISO8601: `created:>2024-01-01` or `created:2024-01-01..2024-12-31`\n\n### Field-Specific Search\n- `in:title` - Search in title only\n- `in:body` - Search in body only\n- `in:comments` - Search in comments only\n\n### Exclusions\n- `-qualifier:value` - Exclude: `-label:bug`, `-language:javascript`\n- `NOT` keyword - For words only: `\"hello NOT world\"`\n\n## Examples\n\n**Find your open issues without bug label:**\n```bash\ngh search issues -- \"is:open author:@me -label:bug\"\n```\n\n**Find popular Python ML repos updated recently:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"machine learning\" --language python --stars \">1000\" --updated \">2024-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Find PRs with specific label and text:**\n```bash\ngh search prs -- ''security label:\"bug fix\" created:>2024-01-01''\n```\n\n**Search code in organization repos:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"TODO\" --owner myorg --language javascript\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Problem | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| `gh search issues -label:bug` | `-label` interpreted as flag | Add `--`: `gh search issues -- \"-label:bug\"` |\n| `gh search repos machine learning` | Searches \"machine\" OR \"learning\" | Quote it: `\"machine learning\"` |\n| `in:title` outside quotes | Shell interprets `:` oddly | Include in query: `\"crash in:title\"` |\n| Mixing `@` with value | Invalid syntax | Use `@me` or username, not both: `author:@me` ✓, `author:@username` ✗ (drop @) |\n| PowerShell without `--%` | Parsing breaks with exclusions | Add `gh --%` before command |\n\n## Output Options\n\nAll subcommands support:\n- `--limit <n>` - Max results (default: 30, max: 1000)\n- `--json <fields>` - JSON output for scripting\n- `--web` - Open results in browser\n- `--sort <field>` - Sort by: comments, created, reactions, updated, stars, etc.\n- `--order asc|desc` - Sort direction (default: desc)\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nCorrect syntax prevents:\n- Command failures from misinterpreted flags\n- Missing results from incorrect exclusions\n- Errors from unquoted spaces\n- Platform-specific parsing issues\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:20:33.951Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CLI Agents requiring advanced GitHub search functionality with exclusion support","zh":"适合需要高级 GitHub 搜索功能且支持排除的 CLI 代理","ja":"CLI エージェントが高度な GitHub 検索機能と除外サポートを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 GitHub 검색 기능과 제외 지원이 필요한 CLI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de CLI que requieren funcionalidad de búsqueda avanzada de GitHub con soporte de exclusión","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CLI nécessitant une fonctionnalité de recherche GitHub avancée avec prise en charge de l''exclusion","de":"Ideal für CLI-Agents, die erweiterte GitHub-Suchfunktionen mit Ausschlussunterstützung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes CLI que exigem funcionalidade de pesquisa avançada do GitHub com suporte a exclusões","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI, требующих расширенную функциональность поиска GitHub с поддержкой исключений","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يتطلب وظائف بحث متقدمة على GitHub مع دعم الإستثناء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform complex GitHub searches using `gh search` subcommands with qualifiers, handling exclusions with `--` prefixes and queries containing spaces or special characters via the GitHub CLI","zh":"使代理能够使用 `gh search` 子命令和限定符执行复杂的 GitHub 搜索，使用 `--` 前缀处理排除，并通过 GitHub CLI 处理包含空格或特殊字符的查询","ja":"エージェントが `gh search` サブコマンドと修飾子を使用して複雑な GitHub 検索を実行できるようにし、 `--` プレフィックスを使用して除外を処理し、GitHub CLI を介して空白文字または特殊文字を含むクエリを処理する","ko":"에이전트가 `gh search` 하위 명령과限定자를 사용하여 복잡한 GitHub 검색을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, `--` 접두사를 사용하여 제외 검색을 처리하고 GitHub CLI를 통해 공백이나 특수 문자가 포함된 쿼리를 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar búsquedas de GitHub complejas utilizando subcomandos `gh search` con calificadores, manejo de exclusiones con prefijos `--` y consultas que contienen espacios o caracteres especiales a través de la CLI de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des recherches GitHub complexes en utilisant des sous-commandes `gh search` avec des qualificateurs, en gérant les exclusions avec des préfixes `--` et des requêtes contenant des espaces ou des caractères spéciaux via la CLI GitHub","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, komplexe GitHub-Suchen mit `gh search`-Unterbefehlen mit Qualifizierern durchzuführen, die Ausschlüsse mit `--`-Präfixen und Abfragen mit Leerzeichen oder Sonderzeichen über die GitHub-CLI handhaben","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar pesquisas complexas no GitHub usando subcomandos `gh search` com qualificadores, tratando exclusões com prefixos `--` e consultas que contenham espaços ou caracteres especiais via a CLI do GitHub","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сложные поиски в GitHub с помощью подкоманд `gh search` с квалификаторами, обрабатывая исключения с префиксами `--` и запросами, содержащими пробелы или специальные символы через GitHub CLI","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء عمليات بحث معقدة على GitHub باستخدام أوامر فرعية `gh search` مع مؤهلات، ومعالجة عمليات البحث باستثناءات باستخدام بادئة `--` والاستفسارات التي تحتوي على مسافات أو رموز خاصة من خلال واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching GitHub repositories for specific code snippets","Constructing complex queries with multiple qualifiers for issues or PRs","Utilizing `--` prefixes for exclusion searches"],"zh":["在 GitHub 存储库中搜索特定的代码片段","使用多个限定符构造复杂的查询以查找问题或 PR","使用 `--` 前缀进行排除搜索"],"ja":["特定のコードスニペットを GitHub リポジトリで検索","複数の修飾子を使用して問題または PR の複雑なクエリを構築","除外検索のために `--` プレフィックスを使用"],"ko":["특정 코드 조각을 GitHub 리포지토리에서 검색","여러限定자를 사용하여 문제 또는 PR에 대한 복잡한 쿼리 구축","제외 검색을 위해 `--` 접두사를 사용"],"es":["Buscar repositorios de GitHub para fragmentos de código específicos","Construir consultas complejas con varios calificadores para problemas o solicitudes de extracción","Utilizar prefijos `--` para búsquedas de exclusión"],"fr":["Rechercher des référentiels GitHub pour des extraits de code spécifiques","Construire des requêtes complexes avec plusieurs qualificateurs pour les problèmes ou les demandes de tirage","Utiliser des préfixes `--` pour les recherches d''exclusion"],"de":["GitHub-Repositorys nach spezifischen Code-Snippets suchen","Komplexe Abfragen mit mehreren Qualifizierern für Probleme oder Pull-Requests erstellen","Verwenden von `--`-Präfixen für Ausschluss-Suchen"],"pt":["Pesquisar repositórios do GitHub para snippets de código específicos","Construir consultas complexas com vários qualificadores para problemas ou PRs","Utilizar prefixos `--` para pesquisas com exclusão"],"ru":["Поиск репозиториев GitHub для конкретных фрагментов кода","Строить сложные запросы с несколькими квалификаторами для проблем или PR","Использовать префиксы `--` для поиска с исключением"],"ar":["بحث مستودعات GitHub لمقتطفات код محددة","بناء استفسارات معقدة مع مؤهلات متعددة لأنواع المشكلات أو طلبات السحب","استخدام البادئة `--` للبحث باستثناء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Shell interpretation limitations for queries with `-` prefixes without `--`"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","对于 `-` 前缀的查询的 shell 解释限制而没有 `--`"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","`--` がない `-` プレフィックスのクエリのシェル解釈の制限"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 필요","`--`가 없는 `-` 접두사의 쿼리에 대한 셸 해석 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Limitaciones de interpretación de shell para consultas con prefijos `-` sin `--`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI GitHub","Limitations d''interprétation du shell pour les requêtes avec des préfixes `-` sans `--`"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub-CLI","Einschränkungen der Shell-Interpretation für Abfragen mit `-`-Präfixen ohne `--`"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da CLI do GitHub","Limitações de interpretação do shell para consultas com prefixos `-` sem `--`"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI","Ограничения интерпретации shell для запросов с префиксами `-` без `--`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","قيود تفسير Shell للاستفسارات ذات البادئة `-` دون `--`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5263fa51a531db41b655db0ed69ca1a347c53d594e409b850d6083c343e32199","qualityScore":75}');
