 Skill - ブラウザ自動化とセキュリティ監査","ko":"Patchright Skill - 브라우저 자동화 및 보안 감사","es":"Patchright: Automatización de navegador con detección de ...","fr":"Patchright : Automatisation de navigateur avec contournem...","de":"Patchright: Browser-Automatisierung mit Bot-Erkennungsumg...","pt":"Patchright Skill: Automação de Navegador com Bypass de De...","ru":"Patchright Skill: Автоматизация браузера с обходом обнару...","ar":"مهارة Patchright: آليّة متصفح مع تحايل على كشف البوت","en":"patchright-skill"},"description":{"zh":"Patchright Skill提供浏览器自动化和安全审计功能，支持localhost、开发服务器和Web应用测试","ja":"Patchright Skillはブラウザ自動化とセキュリティ監査機能を提供し、localhost、開発サーバー、ウェブアプリケーションテストをサポート","ko":"Patchright Skill은 브라우저 자동화 및 보안 감사 기능을 제공하며 localhost, 개발 서버 및 웹 애플리케이션 테스트를 지원","es":"Patchright es una habilidad de automatización de navegador con detección de bots para pruebas de aplicaciones web y capturas de pantalla. Ideal para entornos...","fr":"Patchright est une compétence d''automatisation de navigateur avec contournement de la détection de bots pour les tests d''applications web et les captures d''é...","de":"Patchright ist eine Browser-Automatisierungsfähigkeit mit Bot-Erkennungsumgehung für Web-Anwendungstests und Screenshot-Erfassung. Ideal für Entwicklungsumge...","pt":"A skill Patchright é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador com bypass de detecção de bot, ideal para testes de aplicativos web e capturas de tela.","ru":"Skill Patchright - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера с обходом обнаружения ботов, подходящий для тестирования веб-приложений и захвата экрана.","ar":"مهارة Patchright هي أداة آليّة لمتصفح مع تحايل على كشف البوت، مثالية لاختبار التطبيقات الوبية والتقاط الشاشة.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","bot检测绕过","Web应用测试","localhost和开发服务器支持","一键安装和质量验证"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","ボット検出回避","ウェブアプリケーションテスト","localhostと開発サーバーのサポート","ワンクリックインストールと品質検証"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","봇 감지 우회","웹 애플리케이션 테스트","localhost와 개발 서버 지원","원클릭 설치 및 품질 검증"],"es":["Automatización de navegador con detección de bots","Pruebas de aplicaciones web en entornos de desarrollo","Capturas de pantalla y interacción con la UI","Soporte para localhost y servidores locales","Detección de bots para evitar bloqueos"],"fr":["Automatisation de navigateur avec contournement de la détection de bots","Tests d''applications web dans les environnements de développement","Captures d''écran et interaction avec l''UI","Prise en charge de localhost et de serveurs locaux","Détection de bots pour éviter les blocages"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung mit Bot-Erkennungsumgehung","Web-Anwendungstests in Entwicklungsumgebungen","Screenshot-Erfassung und Interaktion mit der UI","Unterstützung für localhost und lokale Server","Bot-Erkennung zur Vermeidung von Blockierungen"],"pt":["Automação de navegador com bypass de detecção de bot","Testes de aplicativos web","Capturas de tela","Suporte a localhost e servidores de desenvolvimento","Interações de UI","Detecção de URLs e redes"],"ru":["Автоматизация браузера с обходом обнаружения ботов","Тестирование веб-приложений","Захват экрана","Поддержка localhost и серверов разработки","Взаимодействия с UI","Обнаружение URL и сетей"],"ar":["آليّة متصفح مع تحايل على كشف البوت","اختبار التطبيقات الوبية","التقاط الشاشة","دعم localhost وخوادم التطوير","التفاعلات مع واجهة المستخدم","كشف_URL والشبكات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","安全审计","bot检测绕过","Web应用测试","localhost","开发服务器","Patchright Skill"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","セキュリティ監査","ボット検出回避","ウェブアプリケーションテスト","localhost","開発サーバー","Patchright Skill"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","보안 감사","봇 감지 우회","웹 애플리케이션 테스트","localhost","개발 서버","Patchright Skill"],"es":["automatización de navegador","detección de bots","pruebas de aplicaciones web","capturas de pantalla","desarrollo de software","entornos de desarrollo","servidores locales"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","contournement de la détection de bots","tests d''applications web","captures d''écran","développement de logiciels","environnements de développement","serveurs locaux"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","Bot-Erkennungsumgehung","Web-Anwendungstests","Screenshot-Erfassung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsumgebungen","lokale Server"],"pt":["automação de navegador","bypass de detecção de bot","testes de aplicativos web","capturas de tela","localhost","servidores de desenvolvimento","interações de UI","detecção de URLs e redes"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","обход обнаружения ботов","тестирование веб-приложений","захват экрана","localhost","серверы разработки","взаимодействия с UI","обнаружение URL и сетей"],"ar":["آليّة متصفح","تحايل على كشف البوت","اختبار التطبيقات الوبية","التقاط الشاشة","localhost","خوادم التطوير","التفاعلات مع واجهة المستخدم","كشف_URL والشبكات"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"patchright-skill","description":"Patchright-based browser automation with bot detection bypass. Use when Claude needs to interact with local web applications, test localhost/dev servers, take screenshots, or perform UI interactions on private networks. Ideal for QA automation, frontend debugging, E2E testing, and pre-deployment verification on local development environments.","bodyPreview":"# Patchright - Browser Automation Skill\n\nPatchright-based browser automation with bot detection bypass. Use for localhost, dev servers, web app testing, screenshots, and UI interactions.\n\n## Triggers\n\n**URL/Network:**\n- localhost (http://localhost:*, http://127.0.0.1:*)\n- Local IPs (192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x, 172.16-31.x.x)\n- Dev server ports (3000, 5173, 8080, 4200, 5000, etc.)\n\n**Web App Testing:**\n- \"test the app\", \"check the site\"\n- \"open localhost\", \"view in browser\"\n- \"take screenshot\", \"captu","body":"# Patchright - Browser Automation Skill\n\nPatchright-based browser automation with bot detection bypass. Use for localhost, dev servers, web app testing, screenshots, and UI interactions.\n\n## Triggers\n\n**URL/Network:**\n- localhost (http://localhost:*, http://127.0.0.1:*)\n- Local IPs (192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x, 172.16-31.x.x)\n- Dev server ports (3000, 5173, 8080, 4200, 5000, etc.)\n\n**Web App Testing:**\n- \"test the app\", \"check the site\"\n- \"open localhost\", \"view in browser\"\n- \"take screenshot\", \"capture screen\"\n- \"check UI\", \"view page\"\n- QA, E2E testing, dev build verification\n\n**Browser Interaction:**\n- \"click\", \"press button\"\n- \"type\", \"fill form\"\n- \"login\", \"sign up\"\n- \"open menu\", \"click tab\"\n- \"scroll\", \"navigate\"\n\n**Visual Verification:**\n- \"how does it look?\", \"is it working?\"\n- \"check design\", \"verify layout\"\n- \"responsive test\", \"screen size\"\n- \"check rendering\", \"verify component\"\n\n**Development Workflow:**\n- Verify changes after code edits\n- Frontend debugging\n- Real-time dev feedback\n- Pre-deployment checks\n\n## Core: Server Mode (Session Persistence!)\n\n**Problem**: scripts/executor.py terminates process on each call -> browser session lost\n**Solution**: scripts/server.py runs background server -> session persists\n\n### Start Server (Required!)\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/patchright-skill\npython scripts/server.py start &\n```\n\n### Server Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check status\npython scripts/server.py status\n\n# Stop server\npython scripts/server.py stop\n\n# Call tool\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"...\", \"args\": {...}}''\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### 1. Navigate + Screenshot (Most Common Pattern)\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/patchright-skill\n\n# Start server (if not running)\npython scripts/server.py start &\nsleep 2\n\n# Navigate to page\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"navigate\", \"args\": {\"url\": \"http://localhost:3000\"}}''\n\n# Take screenshot\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"screenshot.png\", \"full_page\": true}}''\n```\n\n### 2. Click + Interaction\n\n```bash\n# Click element\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"button.submit\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"#menu-btn\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"body\"}}''  # Click anywhere\n\n# Type text\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"type\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"#email\", \"text\": \"test@test.com\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"type\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"input[name=password]\", \"text\": \"password123\"}}''\n```\n\n### 3. Get Information\n\n```bash\n# Current URL\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"get_url\"}''\n\n# Page title\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"get_title\"}''\n\n# Element text\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"get_text\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \".error-message\"}}''\n```\n\n### 4. Wait\n\n```bash\n# Wait for element to appear\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"wait_for\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \".loading-complete\", \"timeout\": 10000}}''\n```\n\n## Tool Reference\n\n| Tool | Description | Args |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| launch | Start browser | headless: bool (default: false) |\n| close | Close browser | - |\n| navigate | Go to URL | url: string (required) |\n| screenshot | Save to file | path: string, full_page: bool |\n| click | Click element | selector: string (required) |\n| type | Type text | selector: string, text: string |\n| get_text | Get element text | selector: string |\n| wait_for | Wait for element | selector: string, timeout: int |\n| get_url | Get current URL | - |\n| get_title | Get page title | - |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Login Test\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/patchright-skill\npython scripts/server.py start &\nsleep 2\n\n# Navigate to login page\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"navigate\", \"args\": {\"url\": \"http://localhost:3000/login\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"login_page.png\"}}''\n\n# Fill form\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"type\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"#email\", \"text\": \"admin@test.com\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"type\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"#password\", \"text\": \"admin123\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"login_filled.png\"}}''\n\n# Submit\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"button[type=submit]\"}}''\nsleep 2\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"login_result.png\"}}''\n```\n\n### App Navigation\n\n```bash\n# Enter app\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"navigate\", \"args\": {\"url\": \"http://localhost:3000\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \"body\"}}''  # Click to enter\nsleep 2\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"app_main.png\", \"full_page\": true}}''\n\n# Explore features\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"click\", \"args\": {\"selector\": \".create-btn\"}}''\npython scripts/server.py call ''{\"tool\": \"screenshot\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"after_action.png\"}}''\n```\n\n## Selector Tips\n\n```css\n/* ID */\n#submit-btn\n\n/* Class */\n.nav-menu\nbutton.primary\n\n/* Attribute */\ninput[type=email]\nbutton[data-testid=\"login\"]\na[href=\"/about\"]\n\n/* Text content */\ntext=Login\ntext=Submit\n\n/* Combined */\nform#login button[type=submit]\n.sidebar .menu-item:first-child\n```\n\n## Technical Specs\n\n- **Engine**: patchright (undetected playwright fork)\n- **Browser**: Google Chrome (channel: ''chrome'')\n- **Bot Detection Bypass**: YES (Cloudflare, reCAPTCHA, etc.)\n- **Localhost Support**: YES\n- **Private IP Support**: YES\n- **Server Port**: 9222\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"Server not running\" error:**\n```bash\npython scripts/server.py start &\nsleep 2\n```\n\n**Browser not visible:**\n- headless=False is default, browser window should appear\n- In server mode, browser persists in background\n\n**Session disconnected:**\n- Use scripts/server.py instead of scripts/executor.py\n- Server keeps session alive once started\n\n**Element not found:**\n- Use wait_for to wait first\n- Verify selector in DevTools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:33:54.358Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Automation Agents needing secure and verified browser interactions with localhost and dev servers.","zh":"适用于需要在localhost和开发服务器上进行安全和验证的浏览器交互的Web自动化代理。","ja":"ローカルホストと開発サーバーでのセキュアで検証されたブラウザのやりとりが必要なWeb自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"로컬호스트 및 개발 서버에서 보안이 확실하고 검증된 브라우저 상호 작용이 필요한 웹 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización web que necesitan interacciones de navegador seguras y verificadas con localhost y servidores de desarrollo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation web nécessitant des interactions de navigateur sécurisées et vérifiées avec localhost et les serveurs de développement.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Automatisierungsagenten, die sichere und verifizierte Browser-Interaktionen mit localhost und Entwicklungs-Servern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação da Web que necessitam de interações de navegador seguras e verificadas com localhost e servidores de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-автоматизации, которым необходимы безопасные и проверенные взаимодействия браузера с localhost и серверами разработки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الاستخdam التلقائية على الويب التي تحتاج إلى تفاعلات متصفح آمنة ومتحقق من خلال localhost وخوادم التطوير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bypass bot detection and perform UI interactions, web app testing, and screenshot captures using HTTP and localhost protocols, leveraging quality-verified and security-audited skills for Claude, Codex, and Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理绕过机器人检测的能力，并使用HTTP和localhost协议执行UI交互、Web应用程序测试和截图捕获，利用Claude、Codex和Claude Code的质量验证和安全审计技能。","ja":"HTTPとlocalhostのプロトコルを使用して、UIの操作、Webアプリケーションのテスト、スクリーンショットのキャプチャを実行し、ボット検出を回避するClaude、Codex、Claude Codeの品質保証およびセキュリティオーディットスキルを活用してエージェントを強化します。","ko":"HTTP 및 로컬호스트 프로토콜을 사용하여 UI 상호 작용, 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 및 스크린샷 캡처를 수행하고 봇 감지를 우회하는 Claude, Codex 및 Claude Code의 품질 검증 및 보안 감사 기능을 활용하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evitar la detección de bots y realizar interacciones de UI, pruebas de aplicaciones web y capturas de pantalla utilizando los protocolos HTTP y localhost, aprovechando habilidades verificadas de calidad y auditadas de seguridad para Claude, Codex y Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contourner la détection des bots et de réaliser des interactions d''interface utilisateur, des tests d''applications web et des captures d''écran en utilisant les protocoles HTTP et localhost, en exploitant des compétences vérifiées de qualité et auditées de sécurité pour Claude, Codex et Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen und UI-Interaktionen, Web-App-Tests und Screenshot-Erfassungen mithilfe der HTTP- und localhost-Protokolle durchzuführen, indem sie qualitätsgeprüfte und sicherheitsgeprüfte Fähigkeiten für Claude, Codex und Claude Code nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a contornar a detecção de bots e realizar interações de UI, testes de aplicativos da web e capturas de tela usando os protocolos HTTP e localhost, aproveitando habilidades verificadas e auditadas para Claude, Codex e Claude Code.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обходить обнаружение ботов и выполнять взаимодействия с пользовательским интерфейсом, тестирование веб-приложений и захват экрана, используя протоколы HTTP и localhost, используя проверенные и проаудитированные навыки для Claude, Codex и Claude Code.","ar":"يمكن للعمليات الاستخدामية التخلف عن اكتشاف البوتات وأداء تفاعلات واجهة المستخدم واختبار التطبيقات الويب وتسجيل الشاشة باستخدام بروتوكولات HTTP وlocalhost، واستخدام مهارات مدققة ومحسنة للأمان لصالح Claude وCodex وClaude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web app testing on localhost and dev servers","Generating screenshots of web applications for debugging purposes","Interacting with UI elements on local IPs and dev server ports"],"zh":["在localhost和开发服务器上自动化Web应用程序测试","为调试目的生成网页截图","在本地IP和开发服务器端口上与UI元素交互"],"ja":["ローカルホストと開発サーバーでのWebアプリケーションの自動テスト","デバッグ目的のWebアプリケーションのスクリーンショットの生成","ローカルIPと開発サーバーのポートでのUI要素とのやりとり"],"ko":["로컬호스트 및 개발 서버에서 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 자동화","디버깅 목적을 위한 웹 애플리케이션 스크린샷 생성","로컬 IP 및 개발 서버 포트에서 UI 요소와 상호 작용"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de aplicaciones web en localhost y servidores de desarrollo","Generar capturas de pantalla de aplicaciones web para fines de depuración","Interactuar con elementos de la interfaz de usuario en direcciones IP locales y puertos de servidores de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''applications web sur localhost et les serveurs de développement","Générer des captures d''écran d''applications web à des fins de débogage","Interagir avec les éléments d''interface utilisateur sur les adresses IP locales et les ports de serveurs de développement"],"de":["Automatisieren von Web-App-Tests auf localhost und Entwicklungsservern","Erstellen von Screenshots von Webanwendungen zu Debugging-Zwecken","Interagieren mit UI-Elementen auf lokalen IPs und Entwicklungsserver-Ports"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de aplicativos da web em localhost e servidores de desenvolvimento","Gerar capturas de tela de aplicativos da web para fins de depuração","Interagir com elementos de UI em IPs locais e portas de servidores de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования веб-приложений на localhost и серверах разработки","Генерация скриншотов веб-приложений для целей отладки","Взаимодействие с элементами пользовательского интерфейса на локальных IP-адресах и портах серверов разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار التطبيقات الويب على localhost وخوادم التطوير","генерация لقطات شاشة للتطبيقات الويب لأغراض التصحيح","التفاعل مع عناصر واجهة المستخدم على عناوين IP المحلية ومنافذ خوادم التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires localhost or local IP access","Limited to specific dev server ports","May require additional configuration for bot detection bypass"],"zh":["需要localhost或本地IP访问","仅限特定开发服务器端口","可能需要额外配置以绕过机器人检测"],"ja":["ローカルホストまたはローカルIPへのアクセスが必要","特定の開発サーバーのポートに限定される","ボット検出を回避するために追加の構成が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["로컬호스트 또는 로컬 IP 액세스가 필요함","특정 개발 서버 포트에만 제한됨","봇 감지를 우회하려면 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a localhost o IP local","Limitado a puertos de servidores de desarrollo específicos","Puede requerir configuración adicional para evitar la detección de bots"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à localhost ou à une adresse IP locale","Limité à des ports de serveurs de développement spécifiques","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour contourner la détection des bots"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf localhost oder lokale IP","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Entwicklungsserver-Ports","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für die Umgehung der Bot-Erkennung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao localhost ou IP local","Limitado a portas de servidores de desenvolvimento específicas","Pode exigir configuração adicional para contornar a detecção de bots"],"ru":["Требует доступа к localhost или локальному IP-адресу","Ограничен конкретными портами серверов разработки","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для обхода обнаружения ботов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى localhost أو عنوان IP المحلي","محدود بمنافذ خوادم التطوير المحددة","يمكن أن يتطلب تعريفًا إضافيًا لتجاوز اكتشاف البوتات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"162e71fd3b6e3512393b2dc1e125f6ed2560475111b026b5125db2853e1a30ad","qualityScore":75}');
