симизация эффективности токенов","Минимизация задержки","Снижение затрат"],"ar":["إنشاء برومتات مخصصة","تحسين أداء LLM","تقييم البرومتات","تعزيز كفاءة الرموز","تقليل التأخير","تخفيض التكاليف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prompt Engineer","LLM性能优化","提示设计","评估框架","令牌效率","延迟和成本","系统迭代"],"ja":["Prompt Engineer","LLMパフォーマンス最適化","プロンプト設計","評価フレームワーク","トークン効率","遅延とコスト","システム的反復"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어","LLM 성능 최적화","프롬프트 설계","평가 프레임워크","토큰 효율성","지연과 비용","시스템 반복"],"es":["ingeniero de prompts","LLM","diseño de prompts","optimización de rendimiento","evaluación de prompts","eficiencia de tokens","desarrollo de software","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["ingénieur de prompts","LLM","conception de prompts","optimisation des performances","évaluation de prompts","efficacité des tokens","développement de logiciels","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Prompt-Ingenieur","LLM","Prompt-Design","Leistungsoptimierung","Bewertung von Prompts","Token-Effizienz","Software-Entwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["engenheiro de prompt","LLM","prompts personalizados","otimização de desempenho","avaliação de prompts","eficiência de tokens","latência","custos"],"ru":["инженер промпта","LLM","индивидуальные промпты","оптимизация производительности","оценка промптов","эффективность токенов","задержка","затраты"],"ar":["مهندس البرومبت","LLM","برومتات مخصصة","تحسين الأداء","تقييم البرومتات","كفاءة الرموز","التأخير","التكاليف"]}},"owner":"Jeffallan","repo":"claude-skills","repoPath":"Jeffallan/claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineer","description":"Use when designing prompts for LLMs, optimizing model performance, building evaluation frameworks, or implementing advanced prompting techniques like chain-of-thought, few-shot learning, or structured outputs.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Prompt Engineer\n\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in designing, optimizing, and evaluating prompts that maximize LLM performance across diverse use cases.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are an expert prompt engineer with deep knowledge of LLM capabilities, limitations, and prompting techniques. You design prompts that achieve reliable, high-quality outputs while considering token efficiency, latency, and cost. You build evaluation frameworks to measure prompt performance and iterate systematicall","body":"# Prompt Engineer\n\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in designing, optimizing, and evaluating prompts that maximize LLM performance across diverse use cases.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are an expert prompt engineer with deep knowledge of LLM capabilities, limitations, and prompting techniques. You design prompts that achieve reliable, high-quality outputs while considering token efficiency, latency, and cost. You build evaluation frameworks to measure prompt performance and iterate systematically toward optimal results.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing prompts for new LLM applications\n- Optimizing existing prompts for better accuracy or efficiency\n- Implementing chain-of-thought or few-shot learning\n- Creating system prompts with personas and guardrails\n- Building structured output schemas (JSON mode, function calling)\n- Developing prompt evaluation and testing frameworks\n- Debugging inconsistent or poor-quality LLM outputs\n- Migrating prompts between different models or providers\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Understand requirements** - Define task, success criteria, constraints, edge cases\n2. **Design initial prompt** - Choose pattern (zero-shot, few-shot, CoT), write clear instructions\n3. **Test and evaluate** - Run diverse test cases, measure quality metrics\n4. **Iterate and optimize** - Refine based on failures, reduce tokens, improve reliability\n5. **Document and deploy** - Version prompts, document behavior, monitor production\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Prompt Patterns | `references/prompt-patterns.md` | Zero-shot, few-shot, chain-of-thought, ReAct |\n| Optimization | `references/prompt-optimization.md` | Iterative refinement, A/B testing, token reduction |\n| Evaluation | `references/evaluation-frameworks.md` | Metrics, test suites, automated evaluation |\n| Structured Outputs | `references/structured-outputs.md` | JSON mode, function calling, schema design |\n| System Prompts | `references/system-prompts.md` | Persona design, guardrails, context management |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Test prompts with diverse, realistic inputs including edge cases\n- Measure performance with quantitative metrics (accuracy, consistency)\n- Version prompts and track changes systematically\n- Document expected behavior and known limitations\n- Use few-shot examples that match target distribution\n- Validate structured outputs against schemas\n- Consider token costs and latency in design\n- Test across model versions before production deployment\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Deploy prompts without systematic evaluation on test cases\n- Use few-shot examples that contradict instructions\n- Ignore model-specific capabilities and limitations\n- Skip edge case testing (empty inputs, unusual formats)\n- Make multiple changes simultaneously when debugging\n- Hardcode sensitive data in prompts or examples\n- Assume prompts transfer perfectly between models\n- Neglect monitoring for prompt degradation in production\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen delivering prompt work, provide:\n1. Final prompt with clear sections (role, task, constraints, format)\n2. Test cases and evaluation results\n3. Usage instructions (temperature, max tokens, model version)\n4. Performance metrics and comparison with baselines\n5. Known limitations and edge cases\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nPrompt engineering techniques, chain-of-thought prompting, few-shot learning, zero-shot prompting, ReAct pattern, tree-of-thoughts, constitutional AI, prompt injection defense, system message design, JSON mode, function calling, structured generation, evaluation metrics, LLM capabilities (GPT-4, Claude, Gemini), token optimization, temperature tuning, output parsing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:44:01.018Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LLM Agents needing expertly crafted prompts for high-quality outputs and token efficiency.","zh":"非常适合需要专家级提示以获得高质量输出和令牌效率的LLM代理。","ja":"高品質な出力とトークン効率が必要なLLMエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고품질의 출력과 토큰 효율이 필요한 LLM 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes LLM que necesitan instrucciones expertamente elaboradas para obtener salidas de alta calidad y eficiencia de tokens.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents LLM qui ont besoin de invites expertement conçues pour des sorties de haute qualité et une efficacité de tokens.","de":"Perfekt für LLM-Agenten, die expertenmäßig erstellte Prompts für hochwertige Ausgaben und Token-Effizienz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes LLM que precisam de prompts criados por especialistas para saídas de alta qualidade e eficiência de token.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов LLM, которым требуются экспертно разработанные промпты для высококачественных выходов и эффективности токенов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل LLM الذي يحتاج إلى تحفيزات معدة بخبرة لخرج عالي الجودة وكفاءة رمز"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design, optimize, and evaluate prompts that maximize LLM performance across diverse use cases, considering token efficiency, latency, and cost, leveraging techniques such as prompt engineering and evaluation frameworks.","zh":"赋予代理设计、优化和评估提示的能力，以便在多种用例中最大化LLM性能，考虑到令牌效率、延迟和成本，并利用提示工程和评估框架等技术。","ja":"エージェントが設計、最適化、評価するための推奨事項を提供し、トークン効率、遅延、コストなどを考慮して、さまざまなユースケースでLLMのパフォーマンスを最大化し、プロンプトエンジニアリングや評価フレームワークなどの手法を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 설계, 최적화 및 평가하는 것을 가능하게 해 주며, 토큰 효율, 지연, 비용 등을 고려하여 다양한 사용 사례에서 LLM 성능을 최대화하며, 프롬프트 엔지니어링이나 평가 프레임워크와 같은 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar, optimizar y evaluar instrucciones que maximizan el rendimiento de LLM en diversos casos de uso, considerando la eficiencia de tokens, la latencia y el costo, aprovechando técnicas como la ingeniería de instrucciones y los marcos de evaluación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir, d''optimiser et d''évaluer des invites qui maximisent les performances de LLM dans divers cas d''utilisation, en tenant compte de l''efficacité des tokens, de la latence et du coût, en exploitant des techniques telles que l''ingénierie d''invites et les cadres d''évaluation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Prompts zu entwerfen, zu optimieren und zu bewerten, die die LLM-Leistung in verschiedenen Anwendungsfällen maximieren, unter Berücksichtigung von Token-Effizienz, Latenz und Kosten, unter Nutzung von Techniken wie Prompt-Engineering und Bewertungsframeworks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar, otimizar e avaliar prompts que maximizam o desempenho do LLM em diferentes casos de uso, considerando a eficiência de token, a latência e o custo, utilizando técnicas como engenharia de prompt e estruturas de avaliação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать, оптимизировать и оценивать промпты, которые максимизируют производительность LLM в различных сценариях использования, учитывая эффективность токенов, задержку и стоимость, используя такие техники, как инженерия промптов и оценочные фреймворки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم وتحسين وتقييم التحفيزات التي تعظم أداء LLM في حالات استخدام متعددة، مع الأخذ بعين الاعتبار كفاءة الرمز والاتساق والتكلفة، مستخدمًا تقنيات مثل هندسة التحفيز وأطر التقييم."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing reliable prompts for Claude Code","Evaluating prompt performance across different LLMs","Optimizing prompts for low-latency and cost-effective responses"],"zh":["为Claude Code设计可靠的提示","跨不同LLM评估提示性能","优化提示以获得低延迟和成本有效的响应"],"ja":["Claude Codeのための信頼性の高いプロンプトを設計する","さまざまなLLM間でのプロンプトのパフォーマンスを評価する","プロンプトを最適化して低遅延とコスト効率の良いレスポンスを得る"],"ko":["Claude Code를 위한 신뢰할 수 있는 프롬프트 설계","다양한 LLM 간의 프롬프트 성능 평가","프롬프트 최적화하여 낮은 지연 및 비용 효율적인 응답 얻기"],"es":["Diseñar instrucciones confiables para Claude Code","Evaluar el rendimiento de las instrucciones en diferentes LLM","Optimizar instrucciones para respuestas de baja latencia y costo-efectivas"],"fr":["Concevoir des invites fiables pour Claude Code","Évaluer les performances des invites sur différents LLM","Optimiser les invites pour des réponses à faible latence et rentables"],"de":["Entwerfen zuverlässiger Prompts für Claude Code","Bewerten des Prompt-Leistungsverhaltens über verschiedene LLM hinweg","Optimieren von Prompts für niedriglatente und kosteneffiziente Antworten"],"pt":["Projetar prompts confiáveis para Claude Code","Avaliar o desempenho de prompts em diferentes LLM","Otimizar prompts para respostas de baixa latência e baixo custo"],"ru":["Проектировать надежные промпты для Claude Code","Оценивать производительность промптов на разных LLM","Оптимизировать промпты для ответов с низкой задержкой и низкой стоимостью"],"ar":["تصميم تحفيزات موثوقة ل Claude Code","تقييم أداء التحفيزات عبر LLM مختلفة","تحسين التحفيزات لردود سريعة ومتوفرة بتكلفة منخفضة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires deep knowledge of LLM capabilities and limitations","Dependent on specific LLM architectures like Claude Code"],"zh":["需要对LLM能力和限制有深入的了解","依赖于特定的LLM架构，如Claude Code"],"ja":["LLMの能力と制限について深い理解が必要","特定のLLMアーキテクチャー（例：Claude Code）に依存する"],"ko":["LLM 능력 및 제한에 대한 심층적인 이해가 필요","특정 LLM 아키텍처(Claude Code 등)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un conocimiento profundo de las capacidades y limitaciones de LLM","Depende de arquitecturas LLM específicas como Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance approfondie des capacités et des limites de LLM","Dépend de architectures LLM spécifiques comme Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt tiefes Wissen über LLM-Fähigkeiten und -Einschränkungen","Hängt von spezifischen LLM-Architekturen wie Claude Code ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento profundo das capacidades e limitações do LLM","Depende de arquiteturas LLM específicas como o Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует глубоких знаний возможностей и ограничений LLM","Зависит от конкретных архитектур LLM, таких как Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عميقة بقدرات وقيود LLM","يعتمد على هياكل LLM محددة مثل Claude Code"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4725e9bc5a4b3133e9d4a2437b8eeeb3deecbafa4b7d9b97025146ef9f8aa19a","qualityScore":75}');
