:"osay は AI ドライブの音声合成のためのコマンドラインツールであり、テキストを自然な流暢な音声に変換する","ko":"osay는 AI驱动의 음성합성을 위한 명령줄 도구로 텍스트를 자연스럽고流暢한 음성으로 변환","es":"osay es una herramienta de síntesis de voz AI que convierte texto en habla natural para various casos de uso.","fr":"osay est un outil de synthèse vocale IA qui convertit du texte en parole naturelle pour divers cas d''utilisation.","de":"osay ist ein KI-basiertes Sprachsynthese-Tool, das Text in natürliche Sprache für verschiedene Anwendungsfälle konvertiert.","pt":"O osay é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para síntese de fala AI, permitindo converter texto em fala natural para vários casos de uso.","ru":"osay - это инструмент командной строки для синтеза речи AI, позволяющий преобразовать текст в естественную речь для различных случаев использования.","ar":"osay هي أداة سطر الأوامر ل合成 الصوت الذكي، تمكن من تحويل النص إلى صوت طبيعي لاستخدامات مختلفة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持基本用法和发音检查","支持特定语音的选择","支持音频文件的保存","支持命令行工具的使用","支持多种用例"],"ja":["基本的な使用方法と発音の確認をサポート","特定の音声を選択することをサポート","音声ファイルの保存をサポート","コマンドラインツールの使用をサポート","多種多様なユースケースをサポート"],"ko":["기본 사용법과 발음 확인을 지원","특정 음성을 선택할 수 있습니다","음성 파일을 저장할 수 있습니다","명령줄 도구를 사용할 수 있습니다","다양한 용례를 지원"],"es":["Conversión de texto a habla natural","Opción para seleccionar voz específica","Guardado de audio en archivo","Reproducción de último comando","Soporte para varios casos de uso"],"fr":["Conversion de texte en parole naturelle","Option pour sélectionner une voix spécifique","Enregistrement de l''audio dans un fichier","Relecture du dernier commande","Prise en charge de plusieurs cas d''utilisation"],"de":["Konvertierung von Text in natürliche Sprache","Option zur Auswahl einer bestimmten Stimme","Speicherung von Audio in einer Datei","Wiedergabe des letzten Befehls","Unterstützung für verschiedene Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Conversão de texto em fala natural","Opções de voz personalizadas","Salvar áudio em arquivo","Reproduzir último áudio","Suporte a vários casos de uso"],"ru":["Преобразование текста в естественную речь","Настройка голоса","Сохранение аудио в файл","Воспроизведение последнего аудио","Поддержка различных случаев использования"],"ar":["تحويل النص إلى صوت طبيعي","خيارات الصوت المخصصة","حفظ الصوت في ملف","إعادة تشغيل الصوت الأخير","دعم استخدامات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["osay","AI 文本转语音","语音合成","命令行工具","自然流畅的语音","发音检查","音频文件保存"],"ja":["osay","AI テキスト読み上げ","音声合成","コマンドラインツール","自然な流暢な音声","発音の確認","音声ファイル保存"],"ko":["osay","AI 텍스트 음성 합성","음성합성","명령줄 도구","자연스럽고流暢한 음성","발음 확인","음성 파일 저장"],"es":["síntesis de voz AI","herramienta de línea de comandos","conversión de texto a habla","voz natural","casos de uso","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de voz"],"fr":["synthèse vocale IA","outil de ligne de commande","conversion de texte en parole","voix naturelle","cas d''utilisation","développement de logiciels","technologies de voix"],"de":["KI-basierte Sprachsynthese","CLI-Tool","Konvertierung von Text in Sprache","natürliche Sprache","Anwendungsfälle","Softwareentwicklung","Sprachtechnologien"],"pt":["síntese de fala AI","ferramenta de linha de comando","conversão de texto em fala","voz personalizada","áudio em arquivo","reproduzir último áudio","casos de uso"],"ru":["синтез речи AI","инструмент командной строки","преобразование текста в речь","настройка голоса","аудио в файл","воспроизведение последнего аудио","случаи использования"],"ar":["合成 الصوت الذكي","أداة سطر الأوامر","تحويل النص إلى صوت","خيارات الصوت المخصصة","الصوت في ملف","إعادة تشغيل الصوت الأخير","استخدامات متعددة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"osay","description":"AI-powered text-to-speech CLI tool. Use for pronunciation queries, reading text aloud, generating audio files, or language practice. Triggers on how to pronounce, say this, read aloud, TTS, text to speech, speak, or audio generation requests.","bodyPreview":"# osay - AI Text-to-Speech\n\nA CLI tool for AI-powered speech synthesis. Convert text to natural-sounding speech for various use cases.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Show all available options\nosay --help\n\n# Basic usage - speak text\nosay \"Hello, world!\"\n\n# Check pronunciation of unfamiliar words\nosay \"ephemeral\"\nosay \"Nietzsche\"\nosay \"queue\"\n\n# With specific voice\nosay -v coral \"Welcome to the presentation.\"\n\n# Save as audio file\nosay -o output.mp3 \"This will be saved to a file.\"\n\n# Replay last","body":"# osay - AI Text-to-Speech\n\nA CLI tool for AI-powered speech synthesis. Convert text to natural-sounding speech for various use cases.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Show all available options\nosay --help\n\n# Basic usage - speak text\nosay \"Hello, world!\"\n\n# Check pronunciation of unfamiliar words\nosay \"ephemeral\"\nosay \"Nietzsche\"\nosay \"queue\"\n\n# With specific voice\nosay -v coral \"Welcome to the presentation.\"\n\n# Save as audio file\nosay -o output.mp3 \"This will be saved to a file.\"\n\n# Replay last audio\nosay -p\n```\n\n## Use Cases\n\n### 1. Pronunciation Queries\n\nQuickly hear correct pronunciation of unfamiliar words:\n\n```bash\n# English words\nosay \"pronunciation\"\nosay \"worcestershire\"\n\n# Names and proper nouns\nosay \"Dostoevsky\"\nosay \"Nguyen\"\n\n# Technical terms\nosay \"asynchronous\"\nosay \"kubernetes\"\n```\n\n### 2. Content Reading\n\nRead articles, documentation, or text content aloud:\n\n```bash\n# Read a paragraph\nosay \"The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.\"\n\n# With neutral tone (no default cheerfulness)\nosay --no-instructions \"This is a factual news report.\"\n\n# Slow and clear for comprehension\nosay --instructions \"Speak slowly and clearly\" \"Complex technical content here.\"\n```\n\n### 3. Audio Generation\n\nCreate audio files for various purposes:\n\n```bash\n# Podcast intro\nosay -v onyx -o intro.mp3 \"Welcome to the show.\"\n\n# Notification sounds\nosay -o alert.mp3 \"Task completed successfully.\"\n\n# Voice memo\nosay -o memo.mp3 \"Remember to review the pull request tomorrow.\"\n```\n\n### 4. Language Learning\n\nPractice pronunciation and listening comprehension:\n\n```bash\n# Practice sentences\nosay -v coral \"I''d like a cup of coffee, please.\"\n\n# Slow speed for beginners\nosay --instructions \"Speak slowly, pausing between phrases\" \\\n  \"Could you repeat that more slowly?\"\n\n# Natural native speed\nosay --instructions \"Speak at natural native speed\" \\\n  \"I''m gonna grab a coffee real quick.\"\n```\n\nSee [examples/english/SENTENCES.md](examples/english/SENTENCES.md) for practice sentence collections.\n\n## Voices\n\nList available voices with `osay -v ''?''`\n\n| Voice   | Characteristics                    |\n|---------|-----------------------------------|\n| alloy   | Neutral, balanced                 |\n| ash     | Soft, gentle                      |\n| ballad  | Melodic, smooth                   |\n| coral   | Warm, conversational              |\n| echo    | Resonant, clear                   |\n| fable   | Storytelling, narrative           |\n| nova    | Clear, standard                   |\n| onyx    | Deeper, formal                    |\n| sage    | Calm, wise                        |\n| shimmer | Expressive, emotional             |\n\n## Speech Instructions\n\nControl tone and delivery style:\n\n```bash\n# Natural conversation\nosay --instructions \"Speak naturally, like talking to a friend\" \"Hey, what''s up?\"\n\n# Professional presentation\nosay --instructions \"Speak clearly and professionally\" \"Q4 results exceeded expectations.\"\n\n# Emphatic\nosay --instructions \"Speak with enthusiasm\" \"This is amazing news!\"\n\n# Neutral (disable default tone)\nosay --no-instructions \"Objective statement.\"\n```\n\n## Cache Management\n\nAudio files are cached automatically in `~/.osay/audios/`:\n\n```bash\n# List cached audio with metadata\nosay --list-cached\n\n# Replay most recent\nosay -p\nosay --prev\n\n# Select from cache interactively (with fzf)\nosay --play-cached\n\n# Play specific cached audio by ID\nosay --play-cached abc123\n```\n\n## Output Formats\n\nUse `--format` to specify audio format:\n\n| Format | Use Case                          |\n|--------|-----------------------------------|\n| mp3    | Default, general purpose          |\n| opus   | Efficient storage, streaming      |\n| aac    | Apple ecosystem, good compression |\n| flac   | Lossless, archival quality        |\n| wav    | Lossless, editing                 |\n| pcm    | Raw audio, processing             |\n\n```bash\nosay -o output.mp3 \"Default format\"\nosay -o speech.wav --format wav \"High quality audio\"\nosay -o compressed.opus --format opus \"Small file size\"\n```\n\n## Input Methods\n\nMultiple ways to provide text:\n\n```bash\n# Direct text argument\nosay \"Hello, world!\"\n\n# Read from file\nosay -f mytext.txt\nosay -f document.txt -v nova\n\n# Pipe from stdin\necho \"Hello from a pipe\" | osay\ncat article.txt | osay -v coral\n\n# Combine with other commands\ncurl -s https://example.com/quote.txt | osay\n```\n\n## Streaming Mode\n\nUse `--no-cache` for lowest latency (live streaming, no cache):\n\n```bash\n# Quick response without caching\nosay --no-cache \"Instant playback!\"\n\n# Useful for real-time applications\nosay --no-cache -v coral \"This plays immediately\"\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\nProcess multiple texts:\n\n```bash\n# From file (one per line)\nwhile IFS= read -r line; do\n  osay \"$line\"\n  sleep 0.5\ndone < texts.txt\n\n# Generate multiple files\nosay -o file1.mp3 \"First message\"\nosay -o file2.mp3 \"Second message\"\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### API Key Management\n\n```bash\n# Setup OpenAI API key interactively\nosay --setup\n\n# Check if key is configured\nosay --show-key\n\n# Remove stored key\nosay --remove-key\n```\n\n### Environment\n\n- **Config file**: `~/.config/osay/config`\n- **Audio cache**: `~/.osay/audios/`\n- **Environment variable**: `OPENAI_API_KEY` (overrides config file)\n\nFalls back to macOS `say` command if no OpenAI key is available.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:59:25.124Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents requiring advanced text-to-speech capabilities for natural-sounding speech synthesis.","zh":"适合需要高级文本转语音功能以实现自然发音语音合成的对话式代理。","ja":"会話エージェントが高度なテキストを音声への変換機能を必要とする場合に最適です。自然な音声合成を実現します。","ko":"대화형 에이전트가 자연스러운 음성 합성을 위한 고급 텍스트 음성 변환 기능을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de conversación que requieren capacidades avanzadas de texto a voz para una síntesis de habla de sonido natural.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation nécessitant des capacités de texte à parole avancées pour une synthèse de parole à son naturel.","de":"Ideal für Conversational Agents, die erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Fähigkeiten für eine natürliche Sprachsynthese benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação que exigem capacidades avançadas de texto-para-fala para síntese de fala com som natural.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей текст-в-речь для естественно звучащей речевой синтеза.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء المتحدثين التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتحويل النص إلى كلام لتحليل الكلام الطبيعي الصوتي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert text to speech using AI-powered speech synthesis, supporting various voices and audio file formats like .mp3, enabling features such as voice selection and pronunciation checks for unfamiliar words.","zh":"赋予代理将文本转换为语音的能力，使用人工智能驱动的语音合成，支持多种声音和音频文件格式，例如 .mp3，实现语音选择和发音检查等功能，尤其适用于不熟悉的单词。","ja":"エージェントがテキストを音声に変換する機能を提供します。AI駆動の音声合成を使用し、.mp3などの様々な音声やオーディオファイル形式をサポートし、声の選択や不慣れな単語の発音チェックなどの機能を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트를 음성으로 변환할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, AI 기반 음성 합성을 사용하여 다양한 목소리와 오디오 파일 형식(.mp3 등)을 지원하여 목소리 선택 및 발음 확인 등의 기능을 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir texto en habla utilizando la síntesis de habla basada en IA, que admite varias voces y formatos de archivo de audio como .mp3, lo que permite funciones como la selección de voz y la verificación de la pronunciación de palabras desconocidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir le texte en parole à l''aide de la synthèse de parole basée sur l''IA, prenant en charge diverses voix et formats de fichiers audio tels que .mp3, permettant des fonctionnalités telles que la sélection de voix et la vérification de la prononciation de mots inconnus.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Text in Sprache umzuwandeln, indem sie die künstliche Intelligenz-basierte Sprachsynthese verwenden, die verschiedene Stimmen und Audio-Dateiformate wie .mp3 unterstützt, wodurch Funktionen wie Stimmwahl und Ausspracheprüfung für unbekannte Wörter ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converterem texto em fala usando síntese de fala impulsionada por IA, suportando várias vozes e formatos de arquivos de áudio como .mp3, permitindo recursos como seleção de voz e verificações de pronúncia para palavras desconhecidas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать текст в речь с помощью синтеза речи на основе ИИ, поддерживая различные голоса и форматы аудиофайлов, такие как .mp3, позволяя функции, такие как выбор голоса и проверка произношения незнакомых слов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل النص إلى كلام باستخدام تحليل الكلام المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي ، ودعم العديد من الأصوات وتنسيقات الملفات الصوتية مثل .mp3 ، وتمكين الميزات مثل اختيار الصوت واختبارات النطق للكلمات غير المألوفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating audio files for presentations","Checking pronunciation of complex vocabulary","Creating voice-overs for videos"],"zh":["为演示文稿生成音频文件","检查复杂词汇的发音","为视频创建配音"],"ja":["プレゼンテーション用のオーディオファイルを生成する","複雑な語彙の発音を確認する","ビデオ用の声優を制作する"],"ko":["プレゼンテーション용 오디오 파일 생성","복잡한 어휘의 발음을 확인","비디오용 성우 녹음"],"es":["Generar archivos de audio para presentaciones","Comprobar la pronunciación de vocabulario complejo","Crear voz en off para videos"],"fr":["Générer des fichiers audio pour des présentations","Vérifier la prononciation de vocabulaire complexe","Créer des voix off pour des vidéos"],"de":["Erstellen von Audio-Dateien für Präsentationen","Überprüfen der Aussprache von komplexem Vokabular","Erstellen von Voice-overs für Videos"],"pt":["Gerar arquivos de áudio para apresentações","Verificar a pronúncia de vocabulário complexo","Criar voice-overs para vídeos"],"ru":["Генерировать аудиофайлы для презентаций","Проверять произношение сложной лексики","Создавать голос за кадром для видео"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات صوتية للعروض التقديمية","تحقق من نطق المفردات المعقدة","إنشاء صوت خلفي للفيديوهات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI access","Dependent on specific voice availability"],"zh":["需要CLI访问","依赖于特定声音的可用性"],"ja":["CLIアクセスが必要","特定の音声の可用性に依存する"],"ko":["CLI 액세스가 필요","특정 목소리의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la CLI","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de voces específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la CLI","Dépend de la disponibilité de voix spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die CLI","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit spezifischer Stimmen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à CLI","Dependente da disponibilidade de vozes específicas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к CLI","Зависит от наличия конкретных голосов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CLI","يعتمد على توافر أصوات محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"91de467a5add0d269c0e1dbd37b8ec7c72a4e79fab6fb3cd038b526ba71e6884","qualityScore":75}');
