تغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira","Jira REST API","Jira MCP","API","MCP","Jira","Jira","Jira"],"ja":["Jira","Jira REST API","Jira MCP","API","MCP","Jira","Jira","Jira"],"ko":["Jira","Jira REST API","Jira MCP","API","MCP","Jira ","Jira","Jira"],"es":["Jira","gestión de problemas","API de Jira","MCP","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","gestión de proyectos","problemas de Jira","token de API"],"fr":["Jira","gestion de problèmes","API Jira","MCP","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","gestion de projets","problèmes Jira","jeton d''API"],"de":["Jira","Problemmgmt.","Jira-API","MCP","Software-Entwicklung","Team-Kollaboration","Projektmanagement","Jira-Probleme","API-Token"],"pt":["jira issues","gerenciamento de problemas jira","api rest jira","jira mcp","autenticação jira","variáveis de ambiente jira","desenvolvimento jira","integração jira"],"ru":["jira issues","управление проблемами jira","rest api jira","jira mcp","аутентификация jira","переменные среды jira","разработка jira","интеграция jira"],"ar":["مشاكل جيرا","إدارة مشاكل جيرا","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST لجيرا","MCP لجيرا","التحقق من جيرا","متغيرات البيئة لجيرا","تطوير جيرا","تكامل جيرا"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-issues","description":"Create, update, and manage Jira issues from natural language. Use when the user wants to log bugs, create tickets, update issue status, or manage their Jira backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/sec","body":"# Jira Issue Management\n\nCreate and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n### Option 1: Jira MCP Server\nInstall the Jira MCP server for seamless integration:\n```bash\nnpx @anthropic/create-mcp-server jira\n```\n\n### Option 2: Direct API\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nexport JIRA_BASE_URL=\"https://yourcompany.atlassian.net\"\nexport JIRA_EMAIL=\"your-email@company.com\"\nexport JIRA_API_TOKEN=\"your-api-token\"\n```\n\nGet your API token: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens\n\n## Creating Issues\n\n### Basic Issue\n```python\nimport requests\nfrom requests.auth import HTTPBasicAuth\nimport os\n\ndef create_issue(project_key, summary, description, issue_type=\"Task\"):\n    url = f\"{os.environ[''JIRA_BASE_URL'']}/rest/api/3/issue\"\n\n    auth = HTTPBasicAuth(\n        os.environ[''JIRA_EMAIL''],\n        os.environ[''JIRA_API_TOKEN'']\n    )\n\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type}\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()\n\n# Example\nissue = create_issue(\"PROJ\", \"Fix login bug\", \"Users can''t login with SSO\", \"Bug\")\nprint(f\"Created: {issue[''key'']}\")\n```\n\n### With Labels and Priority\n```python\ndef create_detailed_issue(project_key, summary, description,\n                          issue_type=\"Task\", priority=\"Medium\",\n                          labels=None, assignee=None):\n    payload = {\n        \"fields\": {\n            \"project\": {\"key\": project_key},\n            \"summary\": summary,\n            \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"doc\",\n                \"version\": 1,\n                \"content\": [{\n                    \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                    \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": description}]\n                }]\n            },\n            \"issuetype\": {\"name\": issue_type},\n            \"priority\": {\"name\": priority},\n        }\n    }\n\n    if labels:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"labels\"] = labels\n    if assignee:\n        payload[\"fields\"][\"assignee\"] = {\"accountId\": assignee}\n\n    # ... make request\n```\n\n## Common Issue Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| Bug | Something broken |\n| Task | Work item |\n| Story | User-facing feature |\n| Epic | Large initiative |\n| Sub-task | Part of larger task |\n\n## Updating Issues\n\n### Change Status\n```python\ndef transition_issue(issue_key, transition_name):\n    # Get available transitions\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/transitions\"\n    transitions = requests.get(url, auth=auth).json()\n\n    # Find matching transition\n    transition_id = None\n    for t in transitions[''transitions'']:\n        if t[''name''].lower() == transition_name.lower():\n            transition_id = t[''id'']\n            break\n\n    # Execute transition\n    requests.post(url, json={\"transition\": {\"id\": transition_id}}, auth=auth)\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n```python\ndef add_comment(issue_key, comment_text):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/issue/{issue_key}/comment\"\n\n    payload = {\n        \"body\": {\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\n            \"version\": 1,\n            \"content\": [{\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n                \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": comment_text}]\n            }]\n        }\n    }\n\n    requests.post(url, json=payload, auth=auth)\n```\n\n## Searching Issues\n\n### JQL Queries\n```python\ndef search_issues(jql):\n    url = f\"{JIRA_BASE_URL}/rest/api/3/search\"\n    params = {\"jql\": jql, \"maxResults\": 50}\n    response = requests.get(url, params=params, auth=auth)\n    return response.json()[''issues'']\n\n# Examples\nmy_bugs = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND type = Bug AND assignee = currentUser()\")\nopen_items = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND status != Done\")\nrecent = search_issues(\"project = PROJ AND created >= -7d\")\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\nWhen user says... create this:\n\n| Command | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"log bug about X\" | Bug issue with description |\n| \"create task for X\" | Task issue |\n| \"what''s on my plate\" | JQL: assignee = currentUser() AND status != Done |\n| \"move X to done\" | Transition issue to Done |\n| \"add comment to X\" | Add comment to issue |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Summary**: Keep under 80 chars, start with verb (Fix, Add, Update)\n2. **Description**: Include steps to reproduce for bugs\n3. **Labels**: Use for categorization (frontend, backend, urgent)\n4. **Links**: Reference related issues when relevant\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:03:43.086Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing seamless Jira issue integration and REST API capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝集成Jira问题和REST API能力的项目管理代理。","ja":"Jiraの問題をシームレスに統合し、REST APIの機能を必要とするプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Jira 이슈와 REST API 기능을 무缝으로 통합해야 하는 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan una integración de problemas de Jira sin problemas y capacidades de API REST.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une intégration de problèmes Jira transparente et des capacités d''API REST.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agents, die eine nahtlose Jira-ProbleminTEGRATION und REST-API-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de integração perfeita de problemas do Jira e capacidades de API REST.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, требующих бесшовной интеграции проблем Jira и возможностей REST API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المشاريع الذي يحتاج إلى دمج مشاكل جيرا وتوافق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Jira issues using the Jira REST API or MCP, enabling streamlined project tracking and workflow automation through environment variables like JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, and JIRA_API_TOKEN.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Jira问题的能力，使用Jira REST API或MCP，通过环境变量如JIRA_BASE_URL、JIRA_EMAIL和JIRA_API_TOKEN实现项目跟踪和工作流自动化。","ja":"Jira REST APIまたはMCPを使用してJiraの問題を作成および管理する機能をエージェントに与え、環境変数 such as JIRA_BASE_URL、JIRA_EMAIL、JIRA_API_TOKEN を使用してプロジェクトのトラッキングとワークフローの自動化を実現します。","ko":"Jira REST API 또는 MCP를 사용하여 Jira 이슈를 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 제공하여 환경 변수인 JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, JIRA_API_TOKEN을 통해 프로젝트 추적 및 워크플로 자동화를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y administrar problemas de Jira mediante la API REST de Jira o MCP, lo que permite un seguimiento de proyectos simplificado y una automatización de flujo de trabajo a través de variables de entorno como JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL y JIRA_API_TOKEN.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira à l''aide de l''API REST Jira ou de MCP, ce qui permet un suivi de projet simplifié et une automatisation du workflow via des variables d''environnement comme JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL et JIRA_API_TOKEN.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Jira-Probleme mit der Jira-REST-API oder MCP zu erstellen und zu verwalten, wodurch eine vereinfachte Projektverfolgung und eine Automatisierung des Workflows durch Umgebungsvariablen wie JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL und JIRA_API_TOKEN ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar problemas do Jira usando a API REST do Jira ou MCP, permitindo o acompanhamento de projetos e automação de fluxo de trabalho por meio de variáveis de ambiente, como JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL e JIRA_API_TOKEN.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять проблемами Jira с помощью REST API Jira или MCP, обеспечивая упрощенный отслеживание проектов и автоматизацию рабочих процессов посредством переменных среды, таких как JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL и JIRA_API_TOKEN.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء مشاكل جيرا وإدارتها باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا REST أو MCP، مما يتيح تتبع المشاريع وتوضيح سير العمل من خلال متغيرات البيئة مثل JIRA_BASE_URL و JIRA_EMAIL و JIRA_API_TOKEN"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira issue creation","Managing project workflows through MCP","Debugging Jira API connections"],"zh":["自动化Jira问题创建","通过MCP管理项目工作流","调试Jira API连接"],"ja":["Jiraの問題作成の自動化","MCPを介したプロジェクトワークフローの管理","Jira API接続のデバッグ"],"ko":["Jira 이슈 생성 자동화","MCP를 통해 프로젝트 워크플ロー 관리","Jira API 연결 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Jira","Administración de flujos de trabajo de proyectos a través de MCP","Depuración de conexiones de API de Jira"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Jira","Gestion de flux de travail de projet via MCP","Débogage des connexions d''API Jira"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Projekt-Workflows über MCP","Fehlerbehebung von Jira-API-Verbindungen"],"pt":["Automação da criação de problemas do Jira","Gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho de projeto por meio do MCP","Depuração de conexões de API do Jira"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания проблем Jira","Управление рабочими процессами проекта с помощью MCP","Отладка подключений к API Jira"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء مشاكل جيرا","إدارة سير عمل المشاريع من خلال MCP","تصحيح أخطاء اتصالات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira API token","Jira MCP server or direct API setup needed","Dependent on Jira REST API compatibility"],"zh":["需要Jira API令牌","需要Jira MCP服务器或直接API设置","依赖于Jira REST API兼容性"],"ja":["Jira APIトークンが必要","Jira MCPサーバーまたは直接API設定が必要","Jira REST APIの互換性に依存"],"ko":["Jira API 토큰 필요","Jira MCP 서버 또는 직접 API 설정 필요","Jira REST API 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere token de API de Jira","Se necesita servidor MCP de Jira o configuración de API directa","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la API REST de Jira"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API Jira","Serveur MCP Jira ou configuration d''API directe nécessaire","Dépend de la compatibilité de l''API REST Jira"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-API-Token","Jira-MCP-Server oder direkte API-Einrichtung erforderlich","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der Jira-REST-API"],"pt":["Exige token de API do Jira","Servidor Jira MCP ou configuração de API direta necessária","Dependente da compatibilidade da API REST do Jira"],"ru":["Требует токена API Jira","Требуется сервер Jira MCP или прямая настройка API","Зависит от совместимости REST API Jira"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا","مطلوب خادم جيرا MCP أو إعداد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المباشر","يعتمد على توافق واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيرا REST"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"649a1012fe6ddb0e7e86e83e267dd23b27dad0ac22195311205d5d4e7b0632fc","qualityScore":75}');
